          {
            "id": "DJ-traveller-declaration",
            "type": "customs_declaration",
            "name_en": "Traveller baggage and currency declaration (Voyageurs)",
            "name_zh": "旅客行李与货币申报",
            "agency": "Direction Générale des Douanes et Droits Indirects (DGDDI), Djibouti",
            "official_url": "https://douanes.gouv.dj/voyageurs/",
            "channel": "on_arrival",
            "applicability_en": "All travellers arriving in Djibouti must declare the goods they carry and pay the corresponding duties and taxes; the traveller must declare goods in detail, declare currencies and negotiable bearer instruments (cheques, bank cards), and pay duties owed. The page lists import quantity limits without stating a duty exemption for these lines: 1 carton of cigarettes, one 1 L bottle of alcohol, one flask of perfume or toilet water; medicines for personal use allowed with a medical prescription. Carrying goods within these limits is not stated to be duty-free — the traveller's duty to declare and pay corresponding duties and taxes stands. Physical transport of cash of an amount equal to or above 1,000,000 FD (equivalent to USD 5,618) must be declared and automatically justified to the customs authorities by the carrier.",
            "applicability_zh": "所有抵达吉布提的旅客须申报所运货物并缴纳相应税费；旅客须详细申报所携带货物、申报外币和不记名可转让票据（支票、银行卡等）并缴纳税费。官网对以下品目只列了可携带/进口数量限制，并未声明免税：香烟一条、1升装烈酒一瓶、香水或化妆水一瓶；自用药品凭医嘱允许携带。在此数量内携带不等于免税——申报并缴纳相应税费的义务不变。携带等于或超过100万吉布提法郎（等值5618美元）的现金实物出入境，携带人必须向海关当局申报并自动说明来源。",
            "timing_en": "At arrival on Djibouti soil; a downloadable declaration form (formulaire.pdf) is linked from the official travellers page. The customs website also lists an e-service 'Déclaration d'espèces' under E-Services.",
            "timing_zh": "抵达吉布提时办理；官网旅客页提供可下载的申报表（formulaire.pdf）。海关网站 E-Services 菜单下还列有现金申报电子服务（Déclaration d'espèces）。",
            "fee": "unknown",
            "source_ids": [
              "DJ-douanes-voyageurs"
            ],
            "verified_at": "2026-09-10",
            "name_zh_hant": "旅客行李與貨幣申報",
            "applicability_zh_hant": "所有抵達吉布提的旅客須申報所運貨物並繳納相應稅費；旅客須詳細申報所攜帶貨物、申報外幣和不記名可轉讓票據（支票、銀行卡等）並繳納稅費。官網對以下品目只列了可攜帶/進口數量限制，並未聲明免稅：香菸一條、1升裝烈酒一瓶、香水或化妝水一瓶；自用藥品憑醫囑允許攜帶。在此數量內攜帶不等於免稅——申報並繳納相應稅費的義務不變。攜帶等於或超過100萬吉布提法郎（等值5618美元）的現金實物出入境，攜帶人必須向海關當局申報並自動說明來源。",
            "timing_zh_hant": "抵達吉布提時辦理；官網旅客頁提供可下載的申報表（formulaire.pdf）。海關網站 E-Services 菜單下還列有現金申報電子服務（Déclaration d'espèces）。"
          }
