            "channel": "conditional",
            "applicability_en": "Îles Éparses only (Europa, Bassas da India, Juan de Nova, Glorieuses, Tromelin) — not the îles Australes. Mooring in the territorial waters of the îles Éparses and access to the islands are subject to the prior authorization of the préfet administrateur supérieur des TAAF, together with prescriptions framing ecotourism activities (in particular arrêté no. 2014-39 of 25 March 2014); the request uses the activity-authorization forms 1–5 (IEP) published on taaf.fr. The 2026 general Form 1 ('FORMULAIRE DE DÉCLARATION OU DE DEMANDE D’AUTORISATION D’ACCES ET DE MISE EN ŒUVRE D’ACTIVITÉS DANS LES TERRES AUSTRALES FRANÇAISES ET LES ÎLES ÉPARSES') is the same file as the Australes general form and lists the ÎLES ÉPARSES district with the EUROPA, JUAN DE NOVA, BASSAS DA INDIA, TROMELIN and ARCHIPEL DES GLORIEUSES checkboxes; it asks for the applicant (demandeur) only as 'NOM Prénom, fonctions' plus 'organisme' — a named individual with a function and/or an organization — and nowhere requires the applicant to be the vessel's master or owner, so no such restriction is recorded; it covers 'Mouillage- stationnement' and 'Accès, débarquement sur les îles' and the number of persons involved. This is one dossier for the vessel/activity, not an entry card filed by each ordinary passenger; foreign nationals remain covered by the separate TAAF visa procedure. Any movement ashore is forbidden except with prior authorization of the préfet administrateur supérieur, and on Tromelin any disembarkation is impossible. A mooring tax and a territorial stay tax are set by arrêté of the préfet administrateur supérieur and collected by the headquarters services before departure — taxes, not a form-processing fee (amounts not extracted, see unresolved). Fishing is forbidden in the territorial sea around each island.",
            "applicability_zh": "仅适用离散群岛（欧罗巴岛、印度巴萨岛、新胡安岛、格洛里厄斯群岛、特罗姆兰岛）——不含南方群岛。在离散群岛领海停泊及登岛须经 TAAF 高级行政长官（省长）事先许可，并遵守规范生态旅游活动的各项规定（尤其 2014 年 3 月 25 日第 2014-39 号法令）；申请使用 taaf.fr 公布的第 1–5 号（IEP）活动许可表。2026 年总表1与南方群岛页所链为同一官方文件，其辖区勾选含“ÎLES ÉPARSES（离散群岛）”及 EUROPA、JUAN DE NOVA、BASSAS DA INDIA、TROMELIN、ARCHIPEL DES GLORIEUSES 五岛；表上“申请人信息”仅设“NOM Prénom, fonctions（姓名、职能）”与“organisme（所属机构）”栏——具职能的具名个人和/或机构——并未要求申请人须为船长或船东，故此处不作该限定；表含“Mouillage- stationnement（停泊—驻留）”“Accès, débarquement sur les îles（进入、登上诸岛）”活动栏并要求填报参与人数。这是船舶/活动的一份卷宗，不是每名普通乘客分别填写的入境卡；外国公民仍适用另行分离的 TAAF 签证程序。一切上岸活动一律禁止，除非事先取得省长许可；特罗姆兰岛无法登陆。停泊税与领地居留税由省长法令规定，由总部部门出发前征收——此为税款，不是表格手续费（税额本轮未提取，见未决项）。各岛周围领海禁止捕鱼。",
            "timing_en": "The prior authorization of the préfet administrateur supérieur must be obtained before the voyage: the complete dossier in French (general Form 1 plus any complementary forms) is due at saji@taaf.fr at least 2 months before the planned start date of the activity; the mooring and stay taxes are collected by the headquarters services before departure.",
            "timing_zh": "航行前须先取得省长事先许可：完整法语卷宗（总表1及可能的补充表）须至少在预定活动开始日期前 2 个月送达 saji@taaf.fr；停泊税与居留税由总部部门出发前征收。",
