            "channel": "on_departure",
            "applicability_en": "On departure, travelers must declare precious metals and jewelry exceeding 250 g, respect regulated quantity limits per product (e.g. 250 g of hallmarked jewelry, 2 kg of prepared vanilla), and carry required certificates for regulated products (phytosanitary for plants and foodstuffs, sanitary for animals and animal products, export authorization for precious woods).",
