            "applicability_en": "Madagascar Customs offers a mobile app 'Déclaration en Douane MDG' for submitting a baggage declaration before crossing the border; the information is transmitted on arrival to customs via an electronic declaration terminal deployed at international airports. Per the guide: after completing and saving the required information a QR code is generated; on arrival the passport is checked by staff at the customs declaration counter; the declaration details are read by a QR reader; the data is stored on a tablet and verified by customs officers.",
            "applicability_zh": "马达加斯加海关提供手机应用「Déclaration en Douane MDG」，可在过境前提交行李申报；信息在抵达时通过部署在国际机场的电子申报终端传送给海关。按指南所述：填写并保存所需信息后生成二维码；抵达时在海关申报柜台由工作人员核验护照；申报明细由二维码读取器读取；数据存储于平板电脑并由关员核验。",
