          {
            "id": "RE-cash-dalia-declaration",
            "type": "customs_declaration",
            "name_en": "Conditional DALIA e-declaration of cash (argent liquide) for Réunion routes",
            "name_zh": "留尼汪行程现金(argent liquide)DALIA 电子申报(按路线条件适用)",
            "agency": "Direction Générale des Douanes et Droits Indirects (French customs)",
            "official_url": "https://www.douane.gouv.fr/service-en-ligne/declaration-de-capitaux-dalia",
            "channel": "conditional",
            "applicability_en": "This is not a form required of all travelers. It applies only when a natural person (any nationality or residence, including crew members; minors through a parent or legal representative; a carrier acting for others must also declare and identify the owners) physically transports 'argent liquide' — banknotes and coins; bearer-negotiable or endorsable instruments including bearer cheques and travellers' cheques; gold meeting the conditions of EU Regulation 2018/1672; prepaid cards — of a total value of EUR 10,000 or more (threshold inclusive; equivalent in foreign currency counts). Scope is route-based for Réunion (a French DROM): between Réunion and a foreign country — EU member state or third country alike — the declaration is required in both directions, on entering and on leaving; between Réunion and metropolitan France (like any métropole↔DROM/COM transport), the movement is outside the scope of the cash-declaration obligation and no declaration is due.",
            "applicability_zh": "该申报不是所有旅客都必须填写的表格:仅当自然人(任何国籍或居住地,含机组人员;未成年人经父母或法定监护人申报;代他人携带者亦须申报并说明资金所有人)实际携带“现金”(argent liquide)——纸币与硬币;不记名或可背书转让票据(含不记名支票与旅行支票);符合欧盟2018/1672号条例条件的黄金;预付卡——总额达10,000欧元或以上(含正好等于10,000欧元;外币按等值折算)时才适用。适用范围按路线区分(留尼汪为法国海外省DROM):留尼汪与外国之间——无论欧盟成员国还是第三国——入境和出境两个方向均须申报;留尼汪与法国本土之间(如同任何本土↔DROM/COM运输)不在现金申报义务范围内,无需申报。",
            "timing_en": "Conditional by route and amount (see applicability); where required, filing is online only via the DALIA e-declaration service — the handwritten form and the search for a customs office or officer are no longer required. The declaration can be filed at the earliest 30 days before the travel date and at the latest before crossing the border; filing before starting the journey is strongly recommended. Creating an account (email or FranceConnect) is optional but recommended so that declarations can be stored, corrected or cancelled; electronic validation replaces the handwritten signature. At a check, present the DALIA declaration directly on your device or as a printout.",
            "timing_zh": "按路线与金额条件适用(见适用说明);需要申报时仅在线办理,通过 DALIA 电子申报服务——不再需要填写手写表格,也无需寻找海关办公室或关员。申报最早可在旅行日期前30天提交,最迟须在跨越边境前完成;强烈建议在启程前完成申报。可选择创建账户(电子邮箱或 FranceConnect)以便存储、更正或撤销申报(建议创建);电子确认即视为签名。遇检查时,在个人设备上直接出示 DALIA 申报或出示打印件即可。",
            "fee": "unknown",
            "source_ids": [
              "RE-douane-cash",
              "RE-douane-dalia-faq"
            ],
            "verified_at": "2026-09-29",
            "name_zh_hant": "留尼汪行程現金(argent liquide)DALIA 電子申報(按路線條件適用)",
            "applicability_zh_hant": "該申報不是所有旅客都必須填寫的表格:僅當自然人(任何國籍或居住地,含機組人員;未成年人經父母或法定監護人申報;代他人攜帶者亦須申報並說明資金所有人)實際攜帶“現金”(argent liquide)——紙幣與硬幣;不記名或可背書轉讓票據(含不記名支票與旅行支票);符合歐盟2018/1672號條例條件的黃金;預付卡——總額達10,000歐元或以上(含正好等於10,000歐元;外幣按等值折算)時才適用。適用範圍按路線區分(留尼汪為法國海外省DROM):留尼汪與外國之間——無論歐盟成員國還是第三國——入境和出境兩個方向均須申報;留尼汪與法國本土之間(如同任何本土↔DROM/COM運輸)不在現金申報義務範圍內,無需申報。",
            "timing_zh_hant": "按路線與金額條件適用(見適用說明);需要申報時僅線上辦理,通過 DALIA 電子申報服務——不再需要填寫手寫表格,也無需尋找海關辦公室或關員。申報最早可在旅行日期前30天提交,最遲須在跨越邊境前完成;強烈建議在啟程前完成申報。可選擇創建賬戶(電子信箱或 FranceConnect)以便儲存、更正或撤銷申報(建議創建);電子確認即視為簽名。遇檢查時,在個人設備上直接出示 DALIA 申報或出示列印件即可。"
          }
