          {
            "id": "CG-currency-declaration",
            "type": "customs_declaration",
            "name_en": "Declaration to customs of cash above CFA 5,000,000 equivalent when crossing the external CEMAC frontier (Regulation 02/18/CEMAC/UMAC/CM arts. 78-79)",
            "name_zh": "跨越CEMAC对外边境超过500万中非法郎等值现金向海关申报（2018年CEMAC/UMAC外汇条例第78-79条）",
            "agency": "CEMAC / UMAC regional regulation; declared to the customs services at border posts; applicable in Congo-Brazzaville as a CEMAC member state",
            "official_url": "https://sgg.cg/txts-droit-reg/CEMAC-UMAC-Reglement-2018-02-reglementation-des-changes.pdf",
            "channel": "conditional",
            "applicability_en": "Regional rule for natural persons crossing the external frontier of CEMAC, on entry or on exit (art. 78): they may hold without declaration cash not exceeding the equivalent of CFA 5,000,000, foreign currencies and CFA francs combined. Any amount strictly above CFA 5,000,000 or the equivalent in foreign currency, together with the negotiable instruments and securities 'correspondant à ce seuil' (corresponding to that threshold; the text does not state whether the threshold amount itself is included), must be declared to the customs services, failing which the sanctions provided for by the regulations in force apply; the declaration obligation is not performed if the information supplied by the person is incorrect or incomplete. During border-post controls the customs services identify the traveller and may, where necessary, require additional information on the origin of the funds; absent justification of origin, the sums are confiscated and remitted to the Central Bank. Resident travellers entering CEMAC must sell the foreign currency they hold to an authorised intermediary. Art. 79 sets a separate obligation for non-resident travellers leaving CEMAC, not an absolute export cap on all travellers: they may take out foreign currency or any other foreign means of payment up to the amount they declared on entry; where no entry declaration was made, or where they take out sums above their own contributions, they must justify the provenance of amounts above CFA 5,000,000, failing which the sums are confiscated and remitted to the Central Bank. Art. 77 caps the traveller foreign-exchange allocation, all payment means combined, at the equivalent of CFA 5,000,000 per person per trip, and duly justified higher needs are met by authorised intermediaries: it is an allocation channel, not a border form and not an absolute export ceiling. These articles govern crossing the external CEMAC frontier; they do not establish the rules for movements between CEMAC member states, and no Congo border form or fee appears in the official texts read in this batch.",
            "applicability_zh": "适用于自然人跨越CEMAC对外边境入境或出境的区域规定（第78条）：可免申报持有不超过5,000,000中非法郎等值的现金，外币与中非法郎合并计算。严格超过500万中非法郎或其外币等值的任何金额，连同『与该门槛相当』（correspondant à ce seuil）的可转让票据及有价证券（原文未言明是否包含恰好等于该门槛的数额），须向海关申报，违者依现行法规受制裁；所提供信息不正确或不完整的，申报义务即未履行。在边境口岸查验时，海关识别旅客身份，必要时可要求补充资金来源信息；来源无法证明的，款项被没收并缴交中央银行。居民旅客进入CEMAC须将其持有的外币让售给授权中介。第79条是对离境非居民旅客的另一项义务，并非对一切旅客的绝对出口限额：非居民可携出不超过其入境时申报金额的外币或其他外国支付工具；未作入境申报或携出超过本人带入数额的，须对超过5,000,000中非法郎的部分证明来源，否则没收并缴交中央银行。第77条将旅客换汇额度（各种支付方式合并计算）限定为每人每次行程500万中非法郎等值，经充分证明的更高需求由授权中介满足：属配额渠道，非口岸表格，亦非绝对上限。上述条文仅规范跨越CEMAC对外边境，不确立成员国之间移动的规则；本批所读官方文本中没有刚果（布）本国口岸表格或费用。",
            "timing_en": "At the border post, when crossing the external CEMAC frontier in either direction: declare to customs when cash strictly exceeds CFA 5,000,000 equivalent; art. 79 proof of origin is required of non-residents at exit.",
            "timing_zh": "在边境口岸跨越CEMAC对外边境出入境时：现金严格超过5,000,000中非法郎等值即须向海关申报；第79条非居民来源证明于出境时要求。",
            "fee": "unknown",
            "source_ids": [
              "CG-cemac-fx-official"
            ],
            "verified_at": "2026-09-28",
            "name_zh_hant": "跨越CEMAC對外邊境超過500萬中非法郎等值現金向海關申報（2018年CEMAC/UMAC外匯條例第78-79條）",
            "applicability_zh_hant": "適用於自然人跨越CEMAC對外邊境入境或出境的區域規定（第78條）：可免申報持有不超過5,000,000中非法郎等值的現金，外幣與中非法郎合併計算。嚴格超過500萬中非法郎或其外幣等值的任何金額，連同『與該門檻相當』（correspondant à ce seuil）的可轉讓票據及有價證券（原文未言明是否包含恰好等於該門檻的數額），須向海關申報，違者依現行法規受制裁；所提供資訊不正確或不完整的，申報義務即未履行。在邊境口岸查驗時，海關識別旅客身份，必要時可要求補充資金來源資訊；來源無法證明的，款項被沒收並繳交中央銀行。居民旅客進入CEMAC須將其持有的外幣讓售給授權中介。第79條是對離境非居民旅客的另一項義務，並非對一切旅客的絕對出口限額：非居民可攜出不超過其入境時申報金額的外幣或其他外國支付工具；未作入境申報或攜出超過本人帶入數額的，須對超過5,000,000中非法郎的部分證明來源，否則沒收並繳交中央銀行。第77條將旅客換匯額度（各種支付方式合併計算）限定為每人每次行程500萬中非法郎等值，經充分證明的更高需求由授權中介滿足：屬配額渠道，非口岸表格，亦非絕對上限。上述條文僅規範跨越CEMAC對外邊境，不確立成員國之間移動的規則；本批所讀官方文本中沒有剛果（布）本國口岸表格或費用。",
            "timing_zh_hant": "在邊境口岸跨越CEMAC對外邊境出入境時：現金嚴格超過5,000,000中非法郎等值即須向海關申報；第79條非居民來源證明於出境時要求。"
          }
