        "procedures": [
          {
            "id": "NA-baggage-declaration",
            "type": "customs_declaration",
            "name_en": "Baggage Declaration (Arrival and Departure) — Form NamRA-CE-FR-008 (replaces DA 331/NA 305), incl. Section D currency & bearer negotiable instruments",
            "name_zh": "行李申报单（抵达与离境）——NamRA-CE-FR-008 表（替代 DA 331/NA 305），含 D 部分现金与无记名可转让票据申报",
            "agency": "Namibia Revenue Agency (NamRA) — Customs & Excise",
            "official_url": "https://www.namra.org.na/documents/cms/uploaded/baggage-declaration-formcefr008-71abc6ad4e.pdf",
            "channel": "conditional",
            "applicability_en": "Form issued for arrival and departure use. Goods: travellers entering Namibia declare all goods acquired abroad; goods beyond duty-free allowances are declared on this form to NamRA Customs officials on entry, at correct values — failure risks detention or seizure of goods, criminal prosecution or severe penalties (Customs and Excise Act 20 of 1998). Every person travelling together (family) makes an individual declaration; parents/guardians assist minors. Cash: Section D is completed where currency and/or bearer negotiable instruments equivalent to N$100,000.00 or more (inclusive, traveller plus family aggregated) are carried, stating Namibia Dollar value, other currencies, other bearer negotiable instruments (travellers' and personal cheques, money orders, bonds), amounts and source of funds. The NamRA traveller guide separately requires declaration of cash/bearer negotiable instruments/foreign currency in one's possession both on arrival into and when leaving Namibia — broader than the form's Section D N$100,000 threshold; the operative channel below N$100,000 is unverified (unknown).",
            "applicability_zh": "该表供抵达与离境两用。货物：入境旅客须申报境外取得的全部物品，超免税额度部分入境时填本表、按正确价值向 NamRA 海关关员申报——未申报可致物品扣留或没收、刑事追诉或重罚（1998年第20号《海关与货物税法》）。同行家庭每人均须个别申报，父母/监护人协助未成年人。现金：所携货币及/或无记名可转让票据等值达 N$100,000.00 或以上（含本数，旅客与家人合并计算）须填 D 部分，申报纳米比亚元、其他货币、其他无记名票据（旅行支票与个人支票、汇票、债券）、金额及资金来源。NamRA 旅客指南另要求入境及离开纳米比亚时申报所持现金/无记名票据/外币——范围宽于表格 D 部分的 10 万纳元门槛；低于 10 万纳元的操作渠道未证（unknown）。",
            "timing_en": "Goods: on arrival into Namibia, form presented to NamRA Customs officials at the point of entry. Cash: on arrival and, per the NamRA traveller guide, also when leaving Namibia; Section D applies from the equivalent of N$100,000.00 or more (inclusive of the exact amount, aggregating traveller and family).",
            "timing_zh": "货物：抵达纳米比亚时在入境口岸将表格交呈 NamRA 海关关员。现金：抵达时申报，且按 NamRA 旅客指南离开纳米比亚时亦须申报；等值达 N$100,000.00 或以上（严格含本数，旅客与家人合并计算）须填 D 部分。",
            "fee": "unknown",
            "source_ids": [
              "NA-form-declaration-notes",
              "NA-form-sectionD-threshold",
              "NA-guide-declare-duty"
            ],
            "verified_at": "2026-09-28",
            "name_zh_hant": "行李申報單（抵達與離境）——NamRA-CE-FR-008 表（替代 DA 331/NA 305），含 D 部分現金與無記名可轉讓票據申報",
            "applicability_zh_hant": "該表供抵達與離境兩用。貨物：入境旅客須申報境外取得的全部物品，超免稅額度部分入境時填本表、按正確價值向 NamRA 海關關員申報——未申報可致物品扣留或沒收、刑事追訴或重罰（1998年第20號《海關與貨物稅法》）。同行家庭每人均須個別申報，父母/監護人協助未成年人。現金：所攜貨幣及/或無記名可轉讓票據等值達 N$100,000.00 或以上（含本數，旅客與家人合併計算）須填 D 部分，申報納米比亞元、其他貨幣、其他無記名票據（旅行支票與個人支票、匯票、債券）、金額及資金來源。NamRA 旅客指南另要求入境及離開納米比亞時申報所持現金/無記名票據/外幣——範圍寬於表格 D 部分的 10 萬納元門檻；低於 10 萬納元的操作渠道未證（unknown）。",
            "timing_zh_hant": "貨物：抵達納米比亞時在入境口岸將表格交呈 NamRA 海關關員。現金：抵達時申報，且按 NamRA 旅客指南離開納米比亞時亦須申報；等值達 N$100,000.00 或以上（嚴格含本數，旅客與家人合併計算）須填 D 部分。"
          }
        ],
