        "procedures": [
          {
            "id": "BJ-uemoa-2025-currency",
            "type": "customs_declaration",
            "name_en": "Declaration of physical transport of cash and bearer negotiable instruments (BCEAO/UEMOA thresholds)",
            "name_zh": "实体现金及无记名可转让票据运输申报（BCEAO/UEMOA门槛）",
            "agency": "BCEAO (UEMOA) instructions; declaration made to the Benin customs administration at the entry or exit point",
            "official_url": "https://www.bceao.int/sites/default/files/2025-04/Instruction%20n%C2%B0002-03-2025%20du%2018%20mars%202025%20fixant%20le%20seuil%20pour%20la%20d%C3%A9claration%20des%20transports%20physiques%20intracommunautaires%20d%27esp%C3%A8ces%20et%20instruments%20n%C3%A9gociables.pdf",
            "channel": "conditional",
            "applicability_en": "Benin is one of the eight UMOA member states listed by BCEAO, so these regional instructions govern movements through Benin. Any person, resident or non-resident, must declare the physical transport of cash and bearer negotiable instruments to the customs administration at the point of entry or exit of the territory: (1) between UEMOA member states, when the amount reaches at least CFA 10,000,000 — Instruction 002-03-2025 of 18 March 2025, article 1 fixes the threshold ‘à partir duquel’ the declaration is due, so the amount of CFA 10,000,000 itself is included (inclusive, ≥); (2) between a member state and a third state, in either direction, when the amount reaches at least CFA 5,000,000 — Instruction 231/07/2024 of 16 July 2024, article 1, same inclusive construction (≥); it expressly repeals Instruction 008-09-2017 of 25 September 2017. In both cases the declaration is made by the person transporting the funds, at the moment of entry or exit, and breaches attract the sanctions of the uniform AML law. These are the general cash-transport reporting thresholds; the separate 2025 foreign-exchange declaration duties of residents and non-residents are recorded under BJ-bceao-2025-fx-resident and BJ-bceao-2025-fx-nonresident. A Direction générale des douanes manual for Cotonou airport (Indice A, October 2022, site upload directory 2024) records the local action as it then stood — the user made a currency declaration to the customs Brigade when the counter-value was at least CFA 5,000,000 on export — but its body dates from October 2022, before the BCEAO 2024–2025 instructions: it is kept as a background source only (it supports no procedure) and cannot evidence the current routes, populations or thresholds, nor cover non-air ports; the current thresholds rest solely on the two BCEAO instructions above. No fee and no Benin-specific form for this declaration are stated in the official texts read; whether the 06/07/2025/RFE annex form is used for it is unrecorded.",
            "applicability_zh": "BCEAO名录列贝宁为UMOA八个成员国之一，上述区域指令适用于经贝宁的跨境流动。任何人（无论居民或非居民）在领土出入境海关办事点申报实体现金及无记名可转让票据的运输：（1）成员国之间运输，金额达1,000万CFA即须申报——2025年3月18日第002-03-2025号指令第1条以“自该门槛起”（à partir duquel）设定义务，故1,000万CFA本数即触发（含本数，≥）；（2）成员国与第三国之间，任一方向，金额达500万CFA即须申报——2024年7月16日第231/07/2024号指令第1条，同为含本数构造（≥），并明文废止2017年9月25日第008-09-2017号指令。两种情形均由运输人在入出境时亲自向海关申报，违反者适用统一反洗钱法的制裁。此为一般现金运输报告门槛；居民与非居民的2025年外汇申报义务另见BJ-bceao-2025-fx-resident与BJ-bceao-2025-fx-nonresident。贝宁海关总署科托努机场手册（Indice A，正文2022年10月，网站上传目录2024）记录的是当时的本地动作——出口等值≥500万CFA时用户向海关Brigade申报——但其正文早于BCEAO 2024–2025年指令：仅作背景源保留（不支撑任何程序），不能证明现行路线、人群或门槛，也不覆盖非航空口岸；现行门槛仅依据上述两部BCEAO指令。所读官文未载费用，亦未载贝宁本国专用表格；是否使用06/07/2025/RFE附录表格无官文记载。",
            "timing_en": "At the moment of entry or exit, at the customs point of entry or exit of the territory.",
            "timing_zh": "入境或出境时，于领土入出境海关办事点办理。",
            "fee": "unknown",
            "source_ids": [
              "BJ-bceao-members",
              "BJ-bceao-intra-2025",
              "BJ-bceao-extra-2024"
            ],
            "verified_at": "2026-09-28",
            "name_zh_hant": "實體現金及無記名可轉讓票據運輸申報（BCEAO/UEMOA門檻）",
            "applicability_zh_hant": "BCEAO名錄列貝寧為UMOA八個成員國之一，上述區域指令適用於經貝寧的跨境流動。任何人（無論居民或非居民）在領土出入境海關辦事點申報實體現金及無記名可轉讓票據的運輸：（1）成員國之間運輸，金額達1,000萬CFA即須申報——2025年3月18日第002-03-2025號指令第1條以“自該門檻起”（à partir duquel）設定義務，故1,000萬CFA本數即觸發（含本數，≥）；（2）成員國與第三國之間，任一方向，金額達500萬CFA即須申報——2024年7月16日第231/07/2024號指令第1條，同為含本數構造（≥），並明文廢止2017年9月25日第008-09-2017號指令。兩種情形均由運輸人在入出境時親自向海關申報，違反者適用統一反洗錢法的制裁。此為一般現金運輸報告門檻；居民與非居民的2025年外匯申報義務另見BJ-bceao-2025-fx-resident與BJ-bceao-2025-fx-nonresident。貝寧海關總署科托努機場手冊（Indice A，正文2022年10月，網站上傳目錄2024）記錄的是當時的本地動作——出口等值≥500萬CFA時用戶向海關Brigade申報——但其正文早於BCEAO 2024–2025年指令：僅作背景源保留（不支撐任何程序），不能證明現行路線、人群或門檻，也不覆蓋非航空口岸；現行門檻僅依據上述兩部BCEAO指令。所讀官文未載費用，亦未載貝寧本國專用表格；是否使用06/07/2025/RFE附錄表格無官文記載。",
            "timing_zh_hant": "入境或出境時，於領土入出境海關辦事點辦理。"
          }
        ],
