            "name_en": "Departure declaration of traveller goods — verbal up to FCFA 250,000 FOB",
            "name_zh": "离境旅客货物申报——FOB不超过25万西非法郎可口头申报",
            "agency": "Direction Générale des Douanes du Mali (DGDM)",
