            "channel": "on_departure",
            "applicability_en": "On departure from Mali, non-commercial goods exported by travellers whose FOB value does not exceed CFA 250,000 are declared verbally at export; above that threshold they are subject to written declaration filed through an approved customs declarant (déclarant en douane agréé). Commercial goods must be declared through an approved declarant. The observed page sets departure goods rules only: it states no fee and says nothing about entry-side goods, cash declaration forms or border practice. Obtained complete by direct HTTP200 on 2026-09-28 after a one-off DNS resolution; the full official HTML is saved as ml-goods.html/.txt.",
            "applicability_zh": "旅客自马里离境携带出口的非商业物品，FOB价值不超过25万CFA的，出口时口头申报；超过该限额的，须经授权报关人（déclarant en douane agréé）提交书面申报。商业货物须经授权报关人申报。所观察页面仅规定出境货物规则：未载明费用，也未涉及入境物品、现金申报表格或口岸执行。该页于2026-09-28经一次性DNS解析后直连HTTP200完整获取，官方全页HTML已存为ml-goods.html/.txt。",
