            "name_en": "Franchise admission for goods of returning residents (procedure listed; conditions not published)",
            "name_zh": "回国定居者物品免税程序（官方列名；条件未公布）",
            "agency": "Direction Générale des Douanes / Ministère des Finances, Mauritanie",
            "official_url": "https://procedures.gov.mr/fr/procedure/238",
            "channel": "conditional",
            "applicability_en": "People returning permanently may apply for customs-duty and tax relief on objects, effects, furniture and vehicles. The official application page requests a municipal moving certificate stating foreign-residence start/end dates, a vehicle registration in the applicant’s name dated at least one year before return, and a certificate of stay abroad (four years for diplomats, eight for others). Applications are received by the finance ministry cabinet and processed by DGD/D4. The stated processing period is 15 days and the application requires a 20 MRU fiscal stamp. This is an application subject to approval, not automatic traveller exemption.",
            "applicability_zh": "永久回国者可申请物品、个人财物、家具和车辆的关税税费减免。政府详情页要求离境地市政搬迁证明列明境外居住起止日期、申请人名下且回国前至少已登记1年的车辆登记证、境外停留证明（外交人员4年，其他人员8年）。财政部内阁受理、DGD/D4处理；公布处理时间15天，申请需20 MRU印花税票。本项须申请获准，不是普通旅客自动豁免。",
