          {
            "id": "AG-electronic-entry-form",
            "type": "arrival_card",
            "name_en": "Electronic Immigration and Customs form for airport arrivals (ArriveAntigua.com)",
            "name_zh": "机场入境电子移民及海关表（ArriveAntigua.com）",
            "agency": "Antigua and Barbuda immigration/customs authorities (operator of ArriveAntigua.com not named on the airport page; passenger guidance published by V.C. Bird International Airport)",
            "official_url": "https://vcbia.com/customs-and-immigration/",
            "channel": "online",
            "applicability_en": "Passengers travelling to Antigua and Barbuda through V.C. Bird International Airport are encouraged to complete their Immigration and Customs declaration online before arrival at www.ArriveAntigua.com; the previous physical ED card has been replaced by this fully integrated electronic system. Once the form is completed a QR code is issued (save a screenshot, add it to iPhone Wallet, or keep the email confirmation available), and all passengers arriving at V.C. Bird International Airport will be asked to present the Arrive Antigua QR code at customs. Assistance is available on arrival for passengers who require support. No app download is required; the form can be completed using a mobile phone, tablet, or computer, and includes a short questionnaire with questions relating to the stay and customs declaration. The page lists faster arrival and departure processing as a use of the QR code, without creating a separate departure procedure. Answering customs questions and declaring goods obtained abroad or in excess of allowances are recorded separately under AG-arrival-customs-declaration and are not waived by the electronic form.",
            "applicability_zh": "经V.C. Bird国际机场前往安提瓜和巴布达的旅客获鼓励在抵达前于 www.ArriveAntigua.com 在线填写移民及海关申报表；原纸质ED卡已被该一体化电子系统替代。完成后获发二维码（可截图保存、加入iPhone钱包或保留邮件确认），所有抵达V.C. Bird国际机场的旅客在海关处将被要求出示Arrive Antigua二维码。抵达现场为需要协助的旅客提供协助。无需下载App，可用手机、平板或电脑填写；表内含与停留及海关申报有关的简短问卷。页面另将“抵达与出境更快捷”列为出示二维码的用途，但未据此设立单独的出境程序。回答海关提问及申报境外取得物品、超额货物的义务另记于 AG-arrival-customs-declaration，不因电子表而免除。",
            "timing_en": "Within 72 hours of the scheduled flight, before arrival: the same day of travel, the day before travel, or up to three days before travel.",
            "timing_zh": "预定航班时间前72小时内、抵达前填写：出行当天、前一天或最迟三天前均可。",
            "fee": "unknown",
            "source_ids": [
              "AG-vcbia-page"
            ],
            "verified_at": "2026-09-27",
            "name_zh_hant": "機場入境電子移民及海關表（ArriveAntigua.com）",
            "applicability_zh_hant": "經V.C. Bird國際機場前往安提瓜和巴布達的旅客獲鼓勵在抵達前於 www.ArriveAntigua.com 線上填寫移民及海關申報表；原紙質ED卡已被該一體化電子系統替代。完成後獲發 QR Code（可截圖保存、加入iPhone錢包或保留郵件確認），所有抵達V.C. Bird國際機場的旅客在海關處將被要求出示Arrive AntiguaQR Code。抵達現場為需要協助的旅客提供協助。無需下載App，可用手機、平板或電腦填寫；表內含與停留及海關申報有關的簡短問卷。頁面另將“抵達與出境更快捷”列為出示 QR Code 的用途，但未據此設立單獨的出境程序。回答海關提問及申報境外取得物品、超額貨物的義務另記於 AG-arrival-customs-declaration，不因電子表而免除。",
            "timing_zh_hant": "預定航班時間前72小時內、抵達前填寫：出行當天、前一天或最遲三天前均可。"
          },
          {
            "id": "AG-arrival-customs-declaration",
            "type": "customs_declaration",
            "name_en": "Arrival Customs Declaration (goods in excess of the duty-free allowance; cash and negotiable instruments over USD 10,000)",
            "name_zh": "入境海关申报（超免税额货物；超过10,000美元的现金及可转让票据）",
            "agency": "Customs and Excise Division, Antigua and Barbuda (passenger guidance published by V.C. Bird International Airport)",
            "official_url": "https://vcbia.com/customs-and-immigration/",
            "channel": "conditional",
            "applicability_en": "At V.C. Bird International Airport, arriving passengers proceed to the designated Customs line — the \"Nothing to Declare\" line, or the \"Declare\" line if they have something to declare — and should have their Declaration form ready. Per the airport page, the Customs Declaration only needs to be completed by those arriving in Antigua and Barbuda if they have goods in excess of their duty-free allowance; when more than one member of the same household is travelling together, one household member may complete a combined Customs declaration. Cash and negotiable instruments of a value strictly greater than USD $10,000 must be declared to Customs — \"cash\" includes coins and banknotes in any currency, and \"negotiable instruments\" include cheques, travellers' cheques, promissory notes, and money orders; the page is arriving-passenger guidance and states no corresponding departure threshold. Separately, the Customs and Excise Division's Airport Baggage Section page states that all persons entering the country are required by law to declare to Customs anything contained in their baggage, or carried with them, which has been obtained outside of Antigua and Barbuda, and to answer all questions asked by the Customs Officer relating to their travels, baggage, contents and other items being imported; this is a general legal duty on all entrants to declare to Customs and answer the officer's questions, not a requirement that every entrant complete the excess-goods Customs Declaration. The same customs page describes the paper combined Immigration/Customs declaration forms distributed at ports of entry and exit, airline and ships agents, and their offices, and advises filling out the declaration in advance of arrival. Neither page states the relationship between the paper combined form and the ArriveAntigua electronic form, nor whether the excess-goods Customs Declaration is completed on paper or within the electronic form; these remain open under AG-audit-3.",
            "applicability_zh": "在V.C. Bird国际机场，入境旅客前往指定海关队列——“Nothing to Declare”（无申报）队，或如物品须申报则改走“Declare”（申报）队——并应备妥Declaration form（申报表）。按机场页，只有携带超出免税额货物的抵安提瓜和巴布达者才需完成Customs Declaration；同户多名成员同行时，可由一名成员完成合并海关申报。价值严格大于（>）10,000美元（USD $10,000）的现金及可转让票据须向海关申报——“现金”含任何币种的硬币与纸币，“可转让票据”含支票、旅行支票、本票及汇票；该页属入境旅客指引，未陈述对应的出境申报门槛。另据海关及货物税局本域Airport Baggage Section页：所有入境人员依法须向海关申报其行李中或随身携带、在安提瓜和巴布达境外取得的物品，并须回答海关关员就其旅行、行李及内容物与其他进口物品提出的全部问题；此为加于全体入境者“向海关申报并回答关员询问”的一般法定义务，并非要求全体入境者填写超额货物的Customs Declaration。同一海关页述及纸质合并Immigration/Customs申报表于入出境口岸、航司与船舶代理及其办事处发放，并建议抵达前预先填妥。两页均未说明该纸质合并表与ArriveAntigua电子表的关系，亦未说明超额货物Customs Declaration的填写载体（纸质或在电子表内）；两项仍列为未知，记于AG-audit-3。",
            "timing_en": "At arrival customs; the Customs Division page advises completing the declaration in advance of arrival.",
            "timing_zh": "抵达时在海关办理；海关及货物税局页建议抵达前预先填妥申报。",
            "fee": "unknown",
            "source_ids": [
              "AG-vcbia-customs-declaration",
              "AG-vcbia-cash",
              "AG-customs-page"
            ],
            "verified_at": "2026-09-27",
            "name_zh_hant": "入境海關申報（超免稅額貨物；超過10,000美元的現金及可轉讓票據）",
            "applicability_zh_hant": "在V.C. Bird國際機場，入境旅客前往指定海關隊列——“Nothing to Declare”（無申報）隊，或如物品須申報則改走“Declare”（申報）隊——並應備妥Declaration form（申報表）。按機場頁，只有攜帶超出免稅額貨物的抵安提瓜和巴布達者才需完成Customs Declaration；同戶多名成員同行時，可由一名成員完成合並海關申報。價值嚴格大於（>）10,000美元（USD $10,000）的現金及可轉讓票據須向海關申報——“現金”含任何幣種的硬幣與紙幣，“可轉讓票據”含支票、旅行支票、本票及匯票；該頁屬入境旅客指引，未陳述對應的出境申報門檻。另據海關及貨物稅局本域Airport Baggage Section頁：所有入境人員依法須向海關申報其行李中或隨身攜帶、在安提瓜和巴布達境外取得的物品，並須回答海關關員就其旅行、行李及內容物與其他進口物品提出的全部問題；此為加於全體入境者“向海關申報並回答關員詢問”的一般法定義務，並非要求全體入境者填寫超額貨物的Customs Declaration。同一海關頁述及紙質合併Immigration/Customs申報表於入出境口岸、航司與船舶代理及其辦事處發放，並建議抵達前預先填妥。兩頁均未說明該紙質合併表與ArriveAntigua電子表的關係，亦未說明超額貨物Customs Declaration的填寫載體（紙質或在電子表內）；兩項仍列為未知，記於AG-audit-3。",
            "timing_zh_hant": "抵達時在海關辦理；海關及貨物稅局頁建議抵達前預先填妥申報。"
          }
