            "channel": "paper",
            "applicability_en": "Entering or departing Caribbean Netherlands with USD 10,000 or more in cash or negotiable instruments requires declaration, including foreign-currency equivalents and money carried for someone else. People demonstrably travelling together must also report a joint total of USD 10,000 or more. Obtain, complete and submit the form at airport or seaport Customs. No tax is due merely for reporting. 2026-09-29 current page wording: the threshold is inclusive — 'USD 10,000 or more' — and applies whether the carrier owns the cash or is carrying it for somebody else; foreign-currency amounts are converted to USD for the threshold.",
            "applicability_zh": "出入加勒比荷兰携带达到或超过10,000美元的现金或可转让票据须申报，包括等值外币及代他人携带。确实同行的人合计达到该金额也须申报。在机场或海港海关领取、填写并提交表格；申报本身不产生税款。 2026-09-29 现行页面措辞：门槛为含本数「USD 10,000 or more」，无论携带自有现金还是替他人携带均须申报；外币按美元折算计槛。",
            "timing_en": "At entry or departure.",
            "timing_zh": "入境或离境时。",
            "fee": "unknown",
