            "applicability_en": "For baggage that is unaccompanied: the customs notice names the Unaccompanied Baggage Declaration Form (C88) - a form distinct from the traveller's C15 - for goods that must be declared (household items, foodstuff including meats/fruit/vegetables, gifts, alcohol, tobacco, commercial items). The notice states no further eligibility conditions, numeric thresholds or amounts for the C88; its unaccompanied-baggage designation comes from the form's own title. The Airports Authority page repeats the same C15/C88 wording at airport scope only.",
            "applicability_zh": "适用于非随行行李：海关告示点名非随行行李申报表（C88）——与旅客本人的C15为不同表格——用于须申报之物（家用品、含肉/果蔬之食品、礼品、酒、烟、商用物）。告示未另载C88的资格条件、数字门槛或额度；其\"非随行行李\"指向仅来自表名本身。机场管理局页面仅在机场范围重复同一C15/C88表述。",
