          {
            "id": "bz-edeclare",
            "type": "customs_declaration",
            "name_en": "E-Embarkation digital form — Online Immigration and Customs Declaration System (ideclare.gov.bz)",
            "name_zh": "E-Embarkation 在线表单——在线移民与海关申报系统（ideclare.gov.bz）",
            "agency": "Department of Border Management and Immigration Services and Customs and Excise Department, in collaboration with the Ministry of Public Utilities, Energy, Logistics and E-Governance (Belize)",
            "official_url": "https://ideclare.gov.bz",
            "channel": "online",
            "applicability_en": "A Belize Tourism Board announcement of November 27, 2024 states that the Department of Border Management and Immigration Services and the Customs and Excise Department, in collaboration with the Ministry of Public Utilities, Energy, Logistics and E-Governance, have “launched a new Online Immigration and Customs Declaration System”, and that “Beginning December 1, 2024, the system will be available for all arrivals and departures at the Philip Goldson International Airport”, with “a three-month phasing-in to a fully online process”. Launch at that airport, for both arrivals and departures, is thus proven as history. The same announcement adds that by January 1, 2025 the system “will be extended to all ports of entry”; that was a forward plan, and no captured source confirms it was completed, so no all-ports coverage is claimed. The immigration homepage captured 2026-09 still links the “E-Embarkation Form” in airport framing only (“Skip the hassle and save time at the Airport! Complete your E-embarkation form online before your travel.”), consistent with, but not proof of, continued airport-only scope. Who must file, whether filing is mandatory for all travellers, any fee, the field list (including any currency questions), and any nationality or port restriction are stated by no captured page: the announcement gives none, and ideclare.gov.bz returns HTTP 200 but renders only a “Belize_Digital_Forms” JavaScript shell (“Loading...”). The customs_declaration typing rests on the announcement's explicit “Customs Declaration System” wording; the same system also carries the immigration declaration, and this record does not claim it discharges the conditional paper-card duties of s.24(4)(b) or s.33(3) of the Immigration Act (Cap. 156, RE 2020).",
            "applicability_zh": "伯利兹旅游局（BTB）2024-11-27 公告称，边境管理与移民服务局（Department of Border Management and Immigration Services）与海关及消费税局（Customs and Excise Department）会同公共事业、能源、物流与电子政务部“已启动一套新的在线移民与海关申报系统（Online Immigration and Customs Declaration System）”，并称“自 2024 年 12 月 1 日起，该系统将在 Philip Goldson 国际机场对所有到达与出发（arrivals and departures）开放”，且将有“为期三个月、逐步全面线上化的过渡（a three-month phasing-in to a fully online process）”。据此，该机场入/出境双向上线为已证历史事实。同一公告又称系统将于 2025-01-01“扩展至所有入境口岸（will be extended to all ports of entry）”；此为当时的计划，本批无任何来源证实其已完成，故不主张全口岸覆盖。2026 年 9 月抓取的移民局首页仍仅以机场语境链接“E-Embarkation Form”（“Skip the hassle and save time at the Airport! Complete your E-embarkation form online before your travel.”），与机场范围延续一致但不足为证。适用人群、是否对全部旅客强制、任何费用、字段清单（含现金问题）以及国籍/口岸限制，均无任何已抓取页面说明：公告未载，ideclare.gov.bz 返回 HTTP 200 但仅渲染“Belize_Digital_Forms”JavaScript 壳（“Loading...”）。类型记为 customs_declaration 的依据是公告明确的“Customs Declaration System”原文；该系统同时承载移民申报，本记录不主张其免除《移民法》（Cap. 156，2020 修订版）第 24(4)(b) 条或第 33(3) 条的条件性纸质卡义务。",
            "timing_en": "BTB announcement: digital forms “can be accessed and completed in advance of travel”; immigration homepage: complete the form “before your travel”. No N-day filing window or deadline appears on any captured page.",
            "timing_zh": "BTB 公告：数字表“可在行前访问并填写（can be accessed and completed in advance of travel）”；移民局首页要求“出行前（before your travel）”完成。已抓取页面均未给出提前 N 天的窗口或截止时间。",
            "fee": "unknown",
            "source_ids": [
              "bz-immigration-home",
              "bz-edeclare-app",
              "bz-btb-2024"
            ],
            "verified_at": "2026-09-27",
            "name_zh_hant": "E-Embarkation 線上表單——線上移民與海關申報系統（ideclare.gov.bz）",
            "applicability_zh_hant": "伯利茲旅遊局（BTB）2024-11-27 公告稱，邊境管理與移民服務局（Department of Border Management and Immigration Services）與海關及消費稅局（Customs and Excise Department）會同公共事業、能源、物流與電子政務部“已啟動一套新的線上移民與海關申報系統（Online Immigration and Customs Declaration System）”，並稱“自 2024 年 12 月 1 日起，該系統將在 Philip Goldson 國際機場對所有到達與出發（arrivals and departures）開放”，且將有“為期三個月、逐步全面線上化的過渡（a three-month phasing-in to a fully online process）”。據此，該機場入/出境雙向上線為已證歷史事實。同一公告又稱系統將於 2025-01-01“擴展至所有入境口岸（will be extended to all ports of entry）”；此為當時的計劃，本批無任何來源證實其已完成，故不主張全口岸覆蓋。2026 年 9 月抓取的移民局首頁仍僅以機場語境連結“E-Embarkation Form”（“Skip the hassle and save time at the Airport! Complete your E-embarkation form online before your travel.”），與機場範圍延續一致但不足為證。適用人群、是否對全部旅客強制、任何費用、欄位清單（含現金問題）以及國籍/口岸限制，均無任何已抓取頁面說明：公告未載，ideclare.gov.bz 返回 HTTP 200 但僅渲染“Belize_Digital_Forms”JavaScript 殼（“Loading...”）。類型記為 customs_declaration 的依據是公告明確的“Customs Declaration System”原文；該系統同時承載移民申報，本記錄不主張其免除《移民法》（Cap. 156，2020 修訂版）第 24(4)(b) 條或第 33(3) 條的條件性紙質卡義務。",
            "timing_zh_hant": "BTB 公告：數字表“可在行前訪問並填寫（can be accessed and completed in advance of travel）”；移民局首頁要求“出行前（before your travel）”完成。已抓取頁面均未給出提前 N 天的窗口或截止時間。"
          },
          {
            "id": "bz-disembarkation-card",
            "type": "arrival_card",
            "name_en": "Disembarkation card (paper, filled on arrival only if the immigration officer requires it)",
            "name_zh": "入境 disembarkation card（纸质，仅在抵达时应移民官要求填写）",
            "agency": "Border Management and Immigration Services Department, Ministry of Immigration, Governance and Labour (Belize)",
            "official_url": "https://www.agm.gov.bz/uploads/laws/63976edf23cfe_Cap_156_Immigration_Act.pdf",
            "channel": "conditional",
            "applicability_en": "Immigration Act (Cap. 156, Revised Edition 2020), s.24(4): every person entering Belize must truthfully answer the immigration officer's questions and shall, “if required by the immigration officer”, “fill out and sign a disembarkation card” (s.24(4)(b)); a foreigner who refuses to comply with s.24(4) may be refused leave to land (s.24(5), (5A)). The card is conditional on the officer's request; the 2020 Act does not specify whether today's submission medium is paper or digital — the Act makes no online declaration mandatory for all travellers. Current-status limit: the text is as consolidated at 31 December 2020 (no later amendment was captured in this batch), and whether this card is still separately demanded in 2026 — for example at the Philip Goldson International Airport after the online declaration system launched there on 2024-12-01 (see bz-edeclare) — is stated by no captured source; neither the Act, the BTB announcement, nor the immigration homepage says the card was abolished or replaced. No present-day separate card requirement beyond the 2020 statutory text is asserted.",
            "applicability_zh": "《移民法》（Cap. 156，2020 年修订版）第 24(4) 条：每一入境伯利兹的人须如实回答移民官的问题，并“如移民官要求”（if required by the immigration officer）“填写并签署 disembarkation card（入境卡）”（第 24(4)(b) 条）；外国人拒绝遵守第 24(4) 条可被拒绝登陆（第 24(5)、(5A) 条）。该卡为口岸卡，以移民官提出要求为条件——法律并未对所有旅客强制线上申报。现行性限制：条文为 2020 年 12 月 31 日整合版本（本批无后续修订可查），2026 年该卡是否仍被单独要求——例如 Philip Goldson 国际机场自 2024-12-01 上线在线申报系统之后（见 bz-edeclare）——没有任何已抓取来源说明；《移民法》原文、BTB 公告与移民局首页均未称卡已被废除或取代。除 2020 年法条文本外，本记录不主张任何当下的卡要求。",
            "timing_en": "At the place of arrival: persons entering by land or air must forthwith present themselves to the immigration officer (s.24(3)); the card, if demanded, is completed there.",
            "timing_zh": "在抵达地点：经陆路或空路入境者须立即向移民官报到（第 24(3) 条）；如被要求，即在当场填写该卡。",
            "fee": "unknown",
            "source_ids": [
              "bz-law-immigration-s24"
            ],
            "verified_at": "2026-09-27",
            "name_zh_hant": "入境 disembarkation card（紙質，僅在抵達時應移民官要求填寫）",
            "applicability_zh_hant": "《移民法》（Cap. 156，2020 年修訂版）第 24(4) 條：每一入境伯利茲的人須如實回答移民官的問題，並“如移民官要求”（if required by the immigration officer）“填寫並簽署 disembarkation card（入境卡）”（第 24(4)(b) 條）；外國人拒絕遵守第 24(4) 條可被拒絕登陸（第 24(5)、(5A) 條）。該卡為口岸卡，以移民官提出要求為條件——法律並未對所有旅客強制線上申報。現行性限制：條文為 2020 年 12 月 31 日整合版本（本批無後續修訂可查），2026 年該卡是否仍被單獨要求——例如 Philip Goldson 國際機場自 2024-12-01 上線線上申報系統之後（見 bz-edeclare）——沒有任何已抓取來源說明；《移民法》原文、BTB 公告與移民局首頁均未稱卡已被廢除或取代。除 2020 年法條文本外，本記錄不主張任何當下的卡要求。",
            "timing_zh_hant": "在抵達地點：經陸路或空路入境者須立即向移民官報到（第 24(3) 條）；如被要求，即在當場填寫該卡。"
          }
