        "procedures": [
          {
            "id": "cr-declaracion-aduana",
            "type": "customs_declaration",
            "name_en": "Declaración de Aduana (Resolución DGA-372-2009)",
            "name_zh": "哥斯达黎加海关申报表（DGA-372-2009 号决议）",
            "agency": "Dirección General de Aduanas, Ministerio de Hacienda (Costa Rica)",
            "official_url": "https://sinalevi.go.cr/ResultadosNormativa/Informacion?param1=66898&param2=79058&param3=3&param4=2",
            "channel": "paper",
            "applicability_en": "Kept as a historical research record: the description below reflects the Resolución DGA-372-2009 text captured on 2026-09-10; the 2026-09-27 audit could not re-read any current official original, so the resolution's present validity and today's traveller submission process are unverified (see unresolved cr-resolution-updates and cr-source-access). As captured: travellers carrying 'diez mil o más pesos centroamericanos' (ten thousand or more Central American pesos) in cash, or securities of fifty thousand pesos or more, must declare (Ley 8204). Undeclared cash is retained and deposited in an ICD account. The declaration form is issued by the carrier before arrival (Resolución DGA-072-2005). A family travelling together may file one declaration. Duty-free 'bonificación' of 1 to 500 pesos per member applies after 72 hours abroad (48 hours at Paso Canoas) if not used in the previous 6 months. Unaccompanied baggage: 3 months before to 3 months after arrival. Amounts are kept in Central American pesos as written; no USD conversion is asserted by the source text.",
            "applicability_zh": "本记录按历史研究保留：以下描述为 2026-09-10 抓取到的 DGA-372-2009 号决议文本内容；2026-09-27 审计未能重读任何现行官方原文，该决议现行效力与当下旅客提交流程均未核实（见 unresolved cr-resolution-updates、cr-source-access）。所抓内容：携带“1 万（含）以上中美洲比索”现金或 5 万（含）以上比索证券的旅客须申报（第 8204 号法）；未申报现金被扣存 ICD 账户。申报表由承运人抵达前发放（DGA-072-2005 号决议）。同行家庭可合并一份申报。免税“bonificación”每人 1–500 比索，条件为离境满 72 小时（Paso Canoas 口岸 48 小时）且 6 个月内未使用。非随行行李限到达前 3 个月/后 3 个月。金额一律保留原文“中美洲比索”单位，来源文本未做美元换算，本记录也不断言换算值。",
            "timing_en": "As captured 2026-09-10: paper form issued by the carrier before arrival; the duty-free bonificación requires 72 hours abroad (48 hours at Paso Canoas).",
            "timing_zh": "据 2026-09-10 抓取文本：承运人抵达前发放纸质表；免税额度须离境满 72 小时（Paso Canoas 48 小时）。",
            "fee": "unknown",
            "source_ids": [
              "cr-dga372"
            ],
            "verified_at": "2026-09-10",
            "name_zh_hant": "哥斯達黎加海關申報表（DGA-372-2009 號決議）",
            "applicability_zh_hant": "本記錄按歷史研究保留：以下描述為 2026-09-10 抓取到的 DGA-372-2009 號決議文本內容；2026-09-27 審計未能重讀任何現行官方原文，該決議現行效力與當下旅客提交流程均未核實（見 unresolved cr-resolution-updates、cr-source-access）。所抓內容：攜帶“1 萬（含）以上中美洲比索”現金或 5 萬（含）以上比索證券的旅客須申報（第 8204 號法）；未申報現金被扣存 ICD 賬戶。申報表由承運人抵達前發放（DGA-072-2005 號決議）。同行家庭可合併一份申報。免稅“bonificación”每人 1–500 比索，條件為離境滿 72 小時（Paso Canoas 口岸 48 小時）且 6 個月內未使用。非隨行行李限到達前 3 個月/後 3 個月。金額一律保留原文“中美洲比索”單位，來源文本未做美元換算，本記錄也不斷言換算值。",
            "timing_zh_hant": "據 2026-09-10 抓取文本：承運人抵達前發放紙質表；免稅額度須離境滿 72 小時（Paso Canoas 48 小時）。"
          }
        ],
