            "id": "sv-airport-declaration-040",
            "type": "customs_declaration",
            "name_en": "Electronic Baggage / Money Declaration at San Oscar Arnulfo Romero International Airport (Declara / No Declara channels, Boletín DGA 040-2026)",
            "name_zh": "圣奥斯卡·阿努尔福·罗梅罗国际机场行李/现金电子申报（Declara / No Declara 通道，DGA 040-2026 公告）",
            "agency": "Dirección General de Aduanas (DGA), Ministerio de Hacienda, El Salvador",
            "official_url": "https://sitio.aduana.gob.sv/download/boletin-informativo-no-dga-040-2026/",
            "channel": "conditional",
            "applicability_en": "Applies to passengers entering El Salvador through the customs of San Oscar Arnulfo Romero y Galdámez International Airport (Boletín DGA 040-2026 scope; land borders, seaports and other airports are not covered — see unresolved sv-other-ports-declaration). The channel is conditional, chosen per the traveller's situation: on arrival the traveller selects a circuit. \"No Declara\": only baggage, or goods qualifying for the exemptions of the Ley de Equipajes de Viajeros Procedentes del Exterior and not prohibited/restricted; customs staff generate the Boleta Electrónica de Equipaje. \"Declara\": mandatory for non-baggage goods exceeding USD 1,000.00 (this USD 1,000 figure is the channel-selection trigger stated in the bulletin, NOT a duty-free allowance — the USD 500 figures on the legacy 2024 service page belong to the baggage-law exemption regime and must not be conflated with this trigger) and for live animals and firearms; the bulletin's channel description ALSO lists \"money and other assets\" in the Declara enumeration, but that listing carries no amount — the only express money-declaration duty the bulletin states is the USD 15,000.00-or-more threshold at entry or exit (see below), so for money below USD 15,000.00 the bulletin does not say which channel applies, and neither \"must use Declara\" nor \"must use No Declara\" is asserted here (see unresolved sv-below-threshold-cash-channel). Submission is (a) online via the Aduana360 mobile app, option \"Declaración de Viaje\", with the request filed up to 72 hours before travel, or (b) in person at the customs module by telling authorised staff. Cash and goods at airport entry are handled in this single Declara submission; the bulletin establishes no separate money form for entry. The money obligation is bidirectional: the traveller must declare at entry OR exit when carrying cash, monetary instruments, securities or a combination valued at USD 15,000.00 or more (or foreign-currency equivalent); the exit-side obligation is confirmed, but the bulletin does not state the exit submission vehicle — treat it as unconfirmed (sv-exit-cash-vehicle). Delayed (rezagado) and unaccompanied baggage must be declared at entry with the airline receipt; the boleta is issued digitally or physically. The passport is always validated through the electronic declaration; one adult may represent a family group. No fee is stated by the bulletin (recorded as unknown, see sv-fee-current).",
            "applicability_zh": "适用于经圣奥斯卡·阿努尔福·罗梅罗-伊-加尔达梅斯国际机场海关入境萨尔瓦多的旅客（DGA 040-2026 公告适用范围；陆路口岸、海港及其他机场不在覆盖内，见未决项 sv-other-ports-declaration）。渠道为条件式（线上或现场，视旅客情形二选一）：入境时旅客自选通道——\"No Declara\"：仅携带行李、或物品符合《境外旅客行李法》免税豁免且非禁止/限制进口者，由海关授权人员在柜台生成电子行李单（Boleta Electrónica de Equipaje）；\"Declara\"：携带超过 1,000 美元的非行李货物（该 1,000 美元是公告规定的选走 Declara 通道的触发口径，不是免税额——旧 2024 服务页的 500 美元口径属行李法豁免制度，切勿与之混同），以及活体动物、枪械者必走；公告的通道列举还把\"现金和其他资产\"（dinero y otros activos）一并写入 Declara，但该列举未附任何数额——公告对金钱类资产的明示申报义务仅体现为下文入出境价值 ≥15,000 美元（含本数、或外币等值）的门槛，低于 15,000 美元的现金适用哪条通道公告未写明，此处既不断言必走 Declara，也不断言必走 No Declara（见未决项 sv-below-threshold-cash-channel）。提交方式为（a）线上：进入 Aduana360 手机应用，选\"Declaración de Viaje\"录入所需数据，最早可在出行前 72 小时提出申报；或（b）现场：到海关柜台向授权人员说明携带需申报的资产。机场入境时现金与货物在同一 Declara 提交内办理，公告未另立入境现金表格。现金义务双向：入境或出境时携带现金、有价货币工具、有价证券或其组合价值 ≥15,000 美元（含本数，或外币等值）即须申报；出境侧义务已确认，但公告未写明出境提交载体，视为未证实（sv-exit-cash-vehicle）。延误（rezagado）及非随行行李须在入境时凭航空公司单据申报，电子行李单以数字或纸质出具。任何方式均需出示护照经电子申报系统验证；家庭出行可由一名成年代表代全组申报。公告未载明费用（记为 unknown，见 sv-fee-current）。",
            "timing_en": "Online via Aduana360, request filed up to 72 hours before travel; otherwise in person at the airport customs module on arrival. Delayed/unaccompanied baggage declared at entry; boleta presented when bags are picked up.",
            "timing_zh": "线上经 Aduana360 最长可在出行前 72 小时提出申报；否则抵达后在机场海关柜台现场办理。延误/非随行行李须入境时申报，提取行李时出示电子行李单。",
            "fee": "unknown",
