        "procedures": [
          {
            "id": "gt-djrv",
            "type": "customs_declaration",
            "name_en": "Declaración Jurada Regional de Viajero (DJRV)",
            "name_zh": "中美洲区域旅客宣誓申报（DJRV）",
            "agency": "Superintendencia de Administración Tributaria (SAT)",
            "official_url": "https://portal.sat.gob.gt/portal/declaracion-jurada-regional-de-viajero/",
            "channel": "online",
            "applicability_en": "Regional traveler sworn declaration filed electronically with SAT. All travelers entering or leaving Guatemala by air or sea must file it, nationals and foreign travelers alike (SAT customs FAQ); the 2025 SAT guide (p.3) likewise states that all travelers using air or sea means, as applicable, must file when entering or leaving the country. One declaration covers spouses and their minor children; adult children must each file their own (customs FAQ; guide p.13). The form is completed online from any internet-connected device before travel or arrival as directed by SAT, and the traveler or head of family keeps the declaration number/QR code to present to the authorities (guide p.10). A paper form remains only as a contingency when SAT computer systems are unavailable (customs FAQ). Filing is free of charge: the 2025 SAT guide (p.3) says the electronic DJRV is filled “sin costo” (at no cost), while any duties or taxes on goods other than traveler's baggage, where applicable, are payable separately (guide p.11). Land-border crossings are not addressed in the captured official text (see unresolved gt-land-scope).",
            "applicability_zh": "向 SAT 电子填报的区域旅客宣誓申报。SAT 海关 FAQ 明示：凡经空路或海路出入危地马拉的旅客，无论本国人或外国旅客均须填写；SAT 2025 指南第3页亦写所有使用空中或海上交通方式的旅客在入出境时应填。一份申报可覆盖配偶及未成年子女，成年子女须各自另填（海关 FAQ；指南第13页）。可在出行或抵达前按 SAT 指引用任意联网设备在线填报，旅客或户主须保留申报号/二维码以备向当局出示（指南第10页）。纸质表仅作为 SAT 信息系统不可用时的应急渠道（海关 FAQ）。填报本身免费：SAT 2025 指南第3页明示电子 DJRV 填报“sin costo”（无费用），如有超出行李的货物，相应税款视情况另计（指南第11页）。已抓官方正文未涉及陆路口岸（见 unresolved gt-land-scope）。",
            "timing_en": "The electronic form is available 24/7, 365 days a year, and is completed before the flight's arrival (SAT DJRV page; guide p.10); it is valid only on the travel date consigned, otherwise a new declaration with an updated travel date must be filed (guide p.10; customs FAQ). How early it may be filed is disputed between current official texts: the 2025 guide says up to three days before the flight (p.3) and “con tres días de anticipación” (p.13), while the current SAT customs FAQ answers 15 days (noting airlines usually provide the flight number 3 days before travel). No single official window is published; see unresolved gt-advance-window.",
            "timing_zh": "电子表全天候（24 小时、365 天）可填，须在航班抵达前完成（SAT DJRV 专页；指南第10页）；仅在下填报的旅行日期当日有效，否则须更新旅行日期重新填报（指南第10页；海关 FAQ）。提前时限在现行官方资料中相互冲突：2025 指南第3页写最多提前 3 天、第13页写“提前三天”，而 SAT 现行海关 FAQ 答“15 天”（并称航司通常提前 3 天提供航班号）。官方未给出唯一窗口，见 unresolved gt-advance-window。",
            "fee": {
              "amount": 0,
              "currency": "GTQ",
              "note": "SAT 2025 DJRV guide page 3 says filing the electronic declaration is sin costo; any duties or taxes on goods are separate."
            },
            "source_ids": [
              "gt-sat-djrv",
              "gt-sat-faq",
              "gt-djrv-guide"
            ],
            "verified_at": "2026-09-27",
            "name_zh_hant": "中美洲區域旅客宣誓申報（DJRV）",
            "applicability_zh_hant": "向 SAT 電子填報的區域旅客宣誓申報。SAT 海關 FAQ 明示：凡經空路或海路出入危地馬拉的旅客，無論本國人或外國旅客均須填寫；SAT 2025 指南第3頁亦寫所有使用空中或海上交通方式的旅客在入出境時應填。一份申報可覆蓋配偶及未成年子女，成年子女須各自另填（海關 FAQ；指南第13頁）。可在出行或抵達前按 SAT 指引用任意聯網設備線上填報，旅客或戶主須保留申報號/QR Code 以備向當局出示（指南第10頁）。紙質表僅作為 SAT 資訊系統不可用時的應急渠道（海關 FAQ）。填報本身免費：SAT 2025 指南第3頁明示電子 DJRV 填報“sin costo”（無費用），如有超出行李的貨物，相應稅款視情況另計（指南第11頁）。已抓官方正文未涉及陸路口岸（見 unresolved gt-land-scope）。",
            "timing_zh_hant": "電子表全天候（24 小時、365 天）可填，須在航班抵達前完成（SAT DJRV 專頁；指南第10頁）；僅在下填報的旅行日期當日有效，否則須更新旅行日期重新填報（指南第10頁；海關 FAQ）。提前時限在現行官方資料中相互衝突：2025 指南第3頁寫最多提前 3 天、第13頁寫“提前三天”，而 SAT 現行海關 FAQ 答“15 天”（並稱航司通常提前 3 天提供航班號）。官方未給出唯一窗口，見 unresolved gt-advance-window。"
          }
        ],
