          {
            "id": "MX-cash-declaration",
            "type": "customs_declaration",
            "name_en": "Entry and exit cash and receivables declaration",
            "name_zh": "出入境现金及应收凭证申报",
            "agency": "Agencia Nacional de Aduanas de México (ANAM)",
            "official_url": "https://www.anam.gob.mx/declaracion-de-dinero/",
            "channel": "conditional",
            "applicability_en": "Anyone entering or leaving Mexico carrying a combined amount strictly more than US$10,000 equivalent — cash, domestic or foreign cheques, payment orders, any other documents receivable, or a combination — must declare to customs; exactly US$10,000 does not trigger the duty. On entry use the «Declaración de Aduana para pasajeros procedentes del extranjero»; on exit the «Declaración de dinero, salida de pasajeros». If the >US$10,000 answer is yes, additionally complete the detailed «Declaración de Internación o Extracción de Cantidades en Efectivo y/o Documento por Cobrar». The captured arrival form says that this detailed form may be requested from customs staff at ports of entry. Carrying the amount is legal; non-declaration is fined 20–40% of the excess, with imprisonment and forfeiture for larger unreported or illicit-origin amounts.",
            "applicability_zh": "任何人入出墨西哥，携带现金、本国或外国支票、支付指令、其他应收凭证或其合计严格超过10,000美元等值，须向海关申报；恰为10,000美元不触发。入境使用《来自外国的旅客海关申报表》，出境使用《出境旅客资金申报表》；勾选超过10,000美元后，另填《现金及/或应收凭证入出境详情表》。所核入境表说明可向入境口岸海关人员索取该详情表。携带本身合法，未申报按超额部分处20%–40%罚款，未申报数额较大或来源非法另有徒刑及没收。",
            "timing_en": "At the port in either direction: arrival uses the passenger customs declaration, departure the money declaration; both add the detailed form once the US$10,000 threshold is exceeded.",
            "timing_zh": "在口岸按方向办理：入境用旅客海关表，出境用资金表；任一方向超过1万美元均须加填详情表。",
            "fee": "unknown",
            "source_ids": [
              "MX-anam-money",
              "MX-anam-form"
            ],
            "verified_at": "2026-09-27",
            "name_zh_hant": "出入境現金及應收憑證申報",
            "applicability_zh_hant": "任何人入出墨西哥，攜帶現金、本國或外國支票、支付指令、其他應收憑證或其合計嚴格超過10,000美元等值，須向海關申報；恰為10,000美元不觸發。入境使用《來自外國的旅客海關申報表》，出境使用《出境旅客資金申報表》；勾選超過10,000美元后，另填《現金及/或應收憑證入出境詳情表》。所核入境表說明可向入境口岸海關人員索取該詳情表。攜帶本身合法，未申報按超額部分處20%–40%罰款，未申報數額較大或來源非法另有徒刑及沒收。",
            "timing_zh_hant": "在口岸按方向辦理：入境用旅客海關表，出境用資金錶；任一方向超過1萬美元均須加填詳情表。"
          },
          {
            "id": "MX-arrival-goods-declaration",
            "type": "customs_declaration",
            "name_en": "Arrival declaration of taxable goods beyond baggage and allowance",
            "name_zh": "入境行李及免税额以外应税货物申报",
            "agency": "Agencia Nacional de Aduanas de México (ANAM)",
            "official_url": "https://aduanafacil.anam.gob.mx/declaracion_aduanera/crear",
            "channel": "conditional",
            "applicability_en": "Arrival only, conditional: the ANAM passenger customs declaration asks whether the traveller carries taxable merchandise additional to baggage and franquicia; when yes, it records the goods and their value. Franquicia itself is a US$500-equivalent exemption for goods other than baggage entering by land, air or sea, which a family declaring together may pool; alcoholic beverages, manufactured tobacco and motor fuel are excluded. Baggage and goods within the allowance do not by themselves require a taxable-goods entry in the arrival declaration; the official form still says to complete the passenger declaration in full. Qualifying excess goods may be taxed at the 19% global rate where value excluding the allowance is no more than US$3,000 (US$4,000 including computer equipment).",
            "applicability_zh": "仅限入境、条件触发：ANAM旅客海关申报表询问是否携带行李及免税额(franquicia)以外应税货物，答是即填报货物及其价值。免税额本身是陆/空/海入境非行李货物等值500美元的免征税额度，共同申报的家庭可合并使用；酒类、制成烟草、车用燃料除外。行李及额度内货物本身不要求在入境申报表填写应税货物栏；但官方表单仍要求完整填写旅客海关申报表。合条件超额货物可按19%全球税率缴税，扣除额度后不超过3,000美元（含计算机设备4,000美元）。",
            "timing_en": "On arrival, within the «Declaración de Aduana para pasajeros procedentes del extranjero»: answer the taxable-merchandise question and list goods and value when yes.",
            "timing_zh": "入境时在《来自外国的旅客海关申报表》内回答应税货物问题，答是即列明货物与价值。",
            "fee": "unknown",
            "source_ids": [
              "MX-anam-form",
              "MX-anam-info"
            ],
            "verified_at": "2026-09-27",
            "name_zh_hant": "入境行李及免稅額以外應稅貨物申報",
            "applicability_zh_hant": "僅限入境、條件觸發：ANAM旅客海關申報表詢問是否攜帶行李及免稅額(franquicia)以外應稅貨物，答是即填報貨物及其價值。免稅額本身是陸/空/海入境非行李貨物等值500美元的免徵稅額度，共同申報的家庭可合併使用；酒類、製成菸草、車用燃料除外。行李及額度內貨物本身不要求在入境申報表填寫應稅貨物欄；但官方表單仍要求完整填寫旅客海關申報表。合條件超額貨物可按19%全球稅率繳稅，扣除額度後不超過3,000美元（含計算機設備4,000美元）。",
            "timing_zh_hant": "入境時在《來自外國的旅客海關申報表》內回答應稅貨物問題，答是即列明貨物與價值。"
          }
