          {
            "id": "ni-declaracion-viajero",
            "type": "customs_declaration",
            "name_en": "Sistema Declaración de Viajero (DGA)",
            "name_zh": "尼加拉瓜海关旅客申报在线系统",
            "agency": "Dirección General de Servicios Aduaneros (DGA)",
            "official_url": "https://sistemas.dga.gob.ni:8282/Viajeros/",
            "channel": "online",
            "applicability_en": "Form text (Spanish/English): 'TODO VIAJERO O JEFE DE FAMILIA QUE INGRESE O SALGA DEL PAÍS DEBE LLENAR UNA DECLARACIÓN' / 'ALL TRAVELERS OR HEAD FAMILY TO ENTER OR LEAVE THE COUNTRY MUST COMPLETE A DECLARATION' — all travelers or the head of family entering or leaving must declare, covering both ENTRADA/ENTRY and SALIDA/EXIT. One single online registration-and-print submission also carries every declaration topic together: tax exemption enjoyed in the last 6 months; cash, monetary values, titles, objects or precious metals (or a combination) equal to or above US$10,000.00 or equivalent — if yes, category, currency, class of title or precious metal, value in US$, origin and destination of funds; live animals, plants or food products; chemicals, pharmaceuticals, toxic substances or residues, weapons, ammunition or explosives; goods other than baggage; and countries visited in the last 30 days. These topics are one combined submission and are deliberately not split into separate procedures.",
            "applicability_zh": "表单原文（西/英双语）：所有出入境旅客或一家之主（户主）均须填写申报（TODO VIAJERO O JEFE DE FAMILIA QUE INGRESE O SALGA DEL PAÍS DEBE LLENAR UNA DECLARACIÓN / ALL TRAVELERS OR HEAD FAMILY ... MUST COMPLETE A DECLARATION），覆盖入境（ENTRADA/ENTRY）与出境（SALIDA/EXIT）。同一次在线登记并打印的单一提交还合并承载全部申报问项：近6个月是否享受过税费豁免；现金、有价证券、物品、贵金属或其组合等于或超过 US$10,000.00 或等值——答“是”须填类别、币种、证券或贵金属类别、US$ 计价值、资金来源与去向；活体动物、植物或食品；化学品、药品、有毒物质或残留、武器、弹药或爆炸物；行李以外的货物；近30天到访过的国家。以上均为同一提交，刻意不拆分立项。",
            "timing_en": "Resolved from the official portal body text (bilingual): registration is allowed only three days before travel — 'Únicamente puede registrar la información tres días antes de su viaje.' / 'You can only register your information three days before traveling.'",
            "timing_zh": "已由官方门户正文（双语）解决：仅可在出行前3天内登记信息（“Únicamente puede registrar la información tres días antes de su viaje.” / “You can only register your information three days before traveling.”）。",
            "fee": "unknown",
            "source_ids": [
              "ni-dga-viajeros",
              "ni-dga-viajeros-ventana",
              "ni-dga-viajeros-efectivo"
            ],
            "verified_at": "2026-09-27",
            "name_zh_hant": "尼加拉瓜海關旅客申報線上系統",
            "applicability_zh_hant": "表單原文（西/英雙語）：所有出入境旅客或一家之主（戶主）均須填寫申報（TODO VIAJERO O JEFE DE FAMILIA QUE INGRESE O SALGA DEL PAÍS DEBE LLENAR UNA DECLARACIÓN / ALL TRAVELERS OR HEAD FAMILY ... MUST COMPLETE A DECLARATION），覆蓋入境（ENTRADA/ENTRY）與出境（SALIDA/EXIT）。同一次線上登記並列印的單一提交還合併承載全部申報問項：近6個月是否享受過稅費豁免；現金、有價證券、物品、貴金屬或其組合等於或超過 US$10,000.00 或等值——答“是”須填類別、幣種、證券或貴金屬類別、US$ 計價值、資金來源與去向；活體動物、植物或食品；化學品、藥品、有毒物質或殘留、武器、彈藥或爆炸物；行李以外的貨物；近30天到訪過的國家。以上均為同一提交，刻意不拆分立項。",
            "timing_zh_hant": "已由官方門戶正文（雙語）解決：僅可在出行前3天內登記資訊（“Únicamente puede registrar la información tres días antes de su viaje.” / “You can only register your information three days before traveling.”）。"
          }
