            "applicability_en": "Real traveler action, not a separate allowance procedure: on arrival in or return to French Guiana you must declare goods you bought or were given (even if bought all taxes included in metropolitan France) when their value exceeds the duty-free allowance, and pay the local taxes (octroi de mer and octroi de mer régional, Guiana rates). Value allowances per traveler, strictly by direction: (1) from metropolitan France or an EU country to Guiana: EUR 1,000 — the official table shows EUR 1,000 in every age/transport-mode column; (2) from a third country to Guiana: EUR 150 for its 'Voyageurs - de 15 ans' column, EUR 430 for 'Voyageurs + de 15 ans en avion ou en bateau' and EUR 300 for 'Voyageurs + de 15 ans autres modes de transport' — the page does not clarify which column applies to a traveler exactly 15 years old; (3) from Guiana to metropolitan France: the same EUR 150 / 430 / 300, and for this direction the general customs allowances page (updated 2026-08-06) words the categories as 'Voyageurs de moins de 15 ans' and 'Voyageurs de 15 ans et plus' (a traveler exactly 15 belongs to the 15-and-over tier). Quantity allowances per traveler, in both directions (third country / EU country / metropolitan France to Guiana, and Guiana to metropolitan France): tobacco 200 cigarettes or 100 cigarillos or 50 cigars or 250 g of smoking tobacco; alcohol 1 litre if more than 22° or 2 litres if less than 22° (page wording), plus 4 litres of wine and 16 litres of beer; all travelers under 17 are excluded from the tobacco/alcohol allowances — a separate age rule from the 15-year value columns. Allowances cannot be pooled for a single item (a family of four may not combine 4 × EUR 430 for one EUR 1,720 device). An item above the allowance is taxed on its full value without abatement: customs duty (third-country products only), VAT/TVA (in metropolitan France), octroi de mer and octroi de mer régional (Guiana rates); under CGI article 294-1, VAT is not applicable in Guiana itself. Octroi de mer is a local tax — not a customs duty and not a filing fee. This goods declaration is separate from the EUR 10,000 cash declaration.",
            "applicability_zh": "真实旅客动作，免税额度本身不是另一程序：抵达或返回法属圭亚那时，所购或获赠（含在本土已含税购买）物品价值超过免税额度的，须申报并缴纳地方税（octroi de mer 与 octroi de mer régional，按圭亚那税率）。按方向严格区分的每名旅客价值额度：(1) 法国本土或欧盟国家→圭亚那：1,000欧元——官方表格各年龄/交通列均为1,000欧元；(2) 第三国→圭亚那：'Voyageurs - de 15 ans'列150欧元、'Voyageurs + de 15 ans en avion ou en bateau'列430欧元、'Voyageurs + de 15 ans autres modes de transport'列300欧元——页面未澄清恰满15岁者适用哪一列；(3) 圭亚那→法国本土：同为150/430/300欧元，且该方向一般海关额度页（2026-08-06更新）将类别表述为'Voyageurs de moins de 15 ans'与'Voyageurs de 15 ans et plus'（恰满15岁属'15岁及以上'档）。两方向（第三国/欧盟/本土→圭亚那，及圭亚那→本土）的每名旅客量额：烟草200支香烟或100支小雪茄或50支雪茄或250克吸烟用烟丝；酒精超过22°为1升、低于22°为2升（页面原文措辞），另加葡萄酒4升、啤酒16升；未满17岁的所有旅客不享受烟酒免税——与15岁价值档年龄规则相互独立。额度不得为单件物品合并计算（四人家庭不得以4×430欧元合并抵一件1,720欧元的设备）。超额度物品按全额计税、无任何减免：关税（仅限第三国产品）、TVA增值税（在本土）、octroi de mer 与 octroi de mer régional（圭亚那税率）；依CGI第294-1条，圭亚那本地不适用增值税。octroi de mer 为地方税——既非关税，也非申报手续费。本物品申报与1万欧元现金申报为两项独立事项。",
            "timing_en": "On arrival in or return to French Guiana (page wording: 'à votre arrivée ou retour en Guyane'); the outbound direction (Guiana to metropolitan France) is checked on entering metropolitan France. The page names no specific form, channel or office.",
            "timing_zh": "抵达或返回法属圭亚那时办理（页面原文：'à votre arrivée ou retour en Guyane'）；圭亚那→本土方向于进入法国本土时核验。页面未列具体表单、通道或办理点。",
            "fee": "unknown",
