          {
            "id": "GF-cash-declaration",
            "type": "customs_declaration",
            "name_en": "Cash declaration for transport of EUR 10,000 or more between French Guiana and a foreign country",
            "name_zh": "法属圭亚那与外国之间携带1万欧元及以上现金的申报",
            "agency": "Direction générale des douanes et droits indirects (French Customs) — DALIA teleservice",
            "official_url": "https://www.douane.gouv.fr/fiche/obligation-declarative-dargent-liquide",
            "channel": "conditional",
            "applicability_en": "Independent cash-control procedure, separate from goods allowances: any person (French resident or not; minors through a parent or legal representative) transporting cash — banknotes and coins, bearer-negotiable or endorsable instruments (bearer cheques, travellers' cheques, money orders, promissory notes...), gold, and for intra-EU flows prepaid cards — of an amount equal to or above EUR 10,000 (or the equivalent in foreign currency; exactly EUR 10,000 is included) must declare it to French customs. Proven directions for French Guiana (a DROM): between Guiana and a foreign country — a third country (for Guiana, e.g. Brazil or Suriname) or another EU member state — in either direction; the DALIA FAQ states that transports of cash between a DROM/COM and foreign territory (EU member states or third states) must be declared. Explicitly NOT declarable: cash transported between metropolitan France and French Guiana; the DALIA FAQ states this does not fall within the cash declaration obligation (crossing a goods-tax border is not a cash border). Paper channels: the harmonised EU form covers extra-EU movements to or from metropolitan France, the overseas departments (DOM) or Saint-Martin; the national FR form covers intra-EU movements to or from metropolitan France, the DROM or Saint-Martin. No declaration can be filed a posteriori as a regularisation. DROM-to-DROM routes are not named in the FAQ and remain unknown.",
            "applicability_zh": "独立现金管制程序，与物品免税额度分开：任何人员（无论是否法国居民；未成年人经父母或法定代理人）携带现金——纸币与硬币、无记名或可背书转让票据（无记名支票、旅行支票、汇票、本票等）、黄金，以及欧盟内部流向的预付卡——金额等于或超过1万欧元（或等值外币；恰为1万欧元亦须申报）的，须向法国海关申报。已证实的法属圭亚那（DROM）方向：圭亚那与外国之间——第三国（对圭亚那如巴西、苏里南）或其他欧盟成员国——的双向运输；DALIA FAQ明确DROM/COM与外国（欧盟成员国或第三国）之间的现金运输须申报。明确无需申报：法国本土与法属圭亚那之间携带的现金；DALIA FAQ明确其不属于现金申报义务范围（货物税境的跨境不等于现金意义上的国境）。纸质渠道：欧盟统一表格（UE）适用于进出本土、海外省（DOM）或圣马丁的欧盟外流动；法国国家表格（FR）适用于进出本土、海外省与大区（DROM）或圣马丁的欧盟内流动。不得事后补报作regularisation。DROM之间路线FAQ未点名，保留未知。",
            "timing_en": "Electronically via the DALIA teleservice from 30 days before the transport date at the earliest, until before crossing the border on the day of travel; or at a customs office at the moment of entering or leaving French territory.",
            "timing_zh": "最早可自运输日前30天起、最迟于旅行当日过境之前，经DALIA电子申报服务提交；或在出入法国领土之时刻向海关现场申报。",
            "fee": "unknown",
            "source_ids": [
              "GF-cash-douane",
              "GF-dalia-faq"
            ],
            "verified_at": "2026-09-28",
            "name_zh_hant": "法屬圭亞那與外國之間攜帶1萬歐元及以上現金的申報",
            "applicability_zh_hant": "獨立現金管制程序，與物品免稅額度分開：任何人員（無論是否法國居民；未成年人經父母或法定代理人）攜帶現金——紙幣與硬幣、無記名或可背書轉讓票據（無記名支票、旅行支票、匯票、本票等）、黃金，以及歐盟內部流向的預付卡——金額等於或超過1萬歐元（或等值外幣；恰為1萬歐元亦須申報）的，須向法國海關申報。已證實的法屬圭亞那（DROM）方向：圭亞那與外國之間——第三國（對圭亞那如巴西、蘇里南）或其他歐盟成員國——的雙向運輸；DALIA FAQ明確DROM/COM與外國（歐盟成員國或第三國）之間的現金運輸須申報。明確無需申報：法國本土與法屬圭亞那之間攜帶的現金；DALIA FAQ明確其不屬於現金申報義務範圍（貨物稅境的跨境不等於現金意義上的國境）。紙質渠道：歐盟統一表格（UE）適用於進出本土、海外省（DOM）或聖馬丁的歐盟外流動；法國國家表格（FR）適用於進出本土、海外省與大區（DROM）或聖馬丁的歐盟內流動。不得事後補報作regularisation。DROM之間路線FAQ未點名，保留未知。",
            "timing_zh_hant": "最早可自運輸日前30天起、最遲於旅行當日過境之前，經DALIA電子申報服務提交；或在出入法國領土之時刻向海關現場申報。"
          }
