            "official_url": "https://www.sunat.gob.pe/orientacionaduanera/viajeros/equipaje_declaracion_jurada.html",
            "channel": "conditional",
            "applicability_en": "Conditional declaration filed on entry. Required only when accompanied baggage contains any of: (1) goods subject to tax; (2) goods excluded from the baggage and household-goods regime; (3) restricted or prohibited goods; (4) goods for temporary entry; or (5) cash and/or negotiable financial instruments strictly over USD 10,000 or their equivalent in another currency. If the baggage falls entirely within SUNAT's duty-free list, the traveler does not fill this declaration and proceeds to the customs-control exit; the US$ 500 'other goods' allowance is part of that duty-free list, not a standalone procedure. A family unit (spouse, minor children and/or parents) may file a single declaration. Tax charged on goods above the duty-free allowance is a tax on goods, not a fee for filing this form.",
            "applicability_zh": "条件式入境申报。仅当随身行李含以下任一情形时须填表：(1) 应税物品；(2) 被排除在行李/家居用品制度外的货物；(3) 受限或禁止货物；(4) 临时入境货物；或 (5) 严格超过10,000美元（或等值其他货币）的现金及/或可转让金融票据。行李完全落在SUNAT免税清单内时无需填表，直接前往海关监管出口；500美元“其他物品”免税额只是该清单的一部分，不是独立程序。家庭单位（配偶、未成年子女及/或父母）可填报一份申报。超过免税额的货物税是对货物征收的税，不是填表费用。",
            "timing_en": "Paper: international carriers must hand the declaration to travelers before arrival, and it is submitted at the baggage-clearance customs control on arrival — after migration control and baggage claim the traveler approaches the customs control area, where two circuits apply; travelers whose goods all fall in the 'nada por declarar' duty-free list do not file. Digital: SUNAT's current pages instruct travelers to formulate the 'Declaración Jurada de Equipaje y Dinero' in advance through the APP Bienvenido al Perú and present it with the passport to the customs authority. Port-level coverage of the digital channel is not stated in the texts read.",
            "timing_zh": "纸质：国际运输企业须在旅客抵达前发放表格，抵达后在行李通关海关监管环节提交——经移民管制并提取行李后前往海关监管区，该处设有两条通道；物品全部落入“nada por declarar（无申报）”免税清单者不需填报。数字：SUNAT现行页面要求旅客提前通过 APP Bienvenido al Perú 填写“行李及现金宣誓申报”，并携护照向海关当局出示。所读原文未说明数字渠道的适用口岸范围。",
            "fee": "unknown",
