            "channel": "conditional",
            "applicability_en": "Venezuela's Lisbon consulate describes a used-household-goods certificate for Venezuelans or foreigners resident in Venezuela, older than 18, who have lived abroad continuously for at least one year. Goods must have more than six months' use. The certificate is valid for six months. This is a resident household-move procedure, not a general visitor allowance; a consular charge applies but the page requires enquiring for the amount.",
            "applicability_zh": "委内瑞拉驻里斯本领馆说明：具委内瑞拉居民资格的委籍或外籍人士、超过18岁且已连续境外生活至少一年，可办旧家用品使用证书；物品须用过六个月以上，证书有效六个月。此为居民家用品迁移流程，不是一般访客额度；有领事费但网页要求另询金额。",
            "timing_en": "The certificate is valid for six months after issue. A consular appointment is required; the page gives no deadline relative to departure or shipment.",
            "timing_zh": "证书签发后有效六个月，须领馆预约；页面未给相对出发或发运的办理截止。",
            "fee": "unknown",
