            "channel": "conditional",
            "applicability_en": "Turkmen Customs requires written declaration of restricted or dutiable goods; other eligible personal goods may use simplified oral declaration and the green channel, while declarable goods use the red channel. Adults declare; accompanying parents/guardians declare minors goods. The page states duty exemption for hand luggage up to 60 kg including up to 1 kg jewellery; excess weight is charged USD 10 per kg and excess jewellery USD 0.20 per gram. The separate personal-use excise allowance is 1 litre alcohol and 2 packs tobacco. Personal-use status depends on the nature, quantity and frequency of movement. Licences and prohibitions still apply; a duty exemption does not remove them. Prescription medicines for personal treatment require the prescription under the stated guidance.",
            "applicability_zh": "土库曼海关要求受限或应税物品书面申报；符合条件的其他自用物品可简化口头申报并走绿通道，有须申报物品走红通道。成人办理申报，未成年人物品由同行父母或监护人等办理。官方页列手提行李不超过60公斤（含首饰不超过1公斤）免关税；超重每公斤10美元、首饰超1公斤部分每克0.20美元。另列自用消费税免税量为酒1升及烟草2包。自用性质按货物种类、数量及过境频率判断。许可证和禁令仍须遵守，免关税不免许可。个人治疗处方药按指引须随附处方。",
            "timing_en": "At the customs border crossing on entry/exit; corridor choice and declaration at the customs control area.",
            "timing_zh": "出入境时在口岸办理；在海关检查区选择通道并申报。",
            "fee": "unknown",
