            "applicability_en": "Mongolia's eAIP GEN 1.3 (published under the currently valid eAIP; the cached page text carries no amendment date) states that before the aircraft arrives crew assist in giving out Entry Cards and getting passengers to fill them out (2.1.1), and that passengers must fill out an Entry Card when entering or leaving Mongolia, presenting it together with international travel documents at border control examination (2.1.2). This is an immigration border-control card, not a customs form. The evidence covers air travel only; whether Entry Cards are used at land border checkpoints is not established by this source and remains unknown.",
            "applicability_zh": "蒙古eAIP GEN 1.3（收录于现行有效eAIP发布；缓存页面文本未显示修订日期）载明：航班抵达前机组协助发放Entry Card并指导乘客填写（2.1.1）；乘客进出蒙古须填写Entry Card，并连同国际旅行证件一并交边防检查查验（2.1.2）。该卡属边检环节单证，不是海关表格。上述证据仅覆盖航空旅行；Entry Card在陆路口岸是否使用，本来源不能证明，仍为未知。",
