            "applicability_en": "Customs' current arrival guidance directs passengers arriving by land (PLBN border-crossing posts) and passengers departing abroad carrying cash of Rp 100 million equivalent or more, or certain other goods, to fill the customs declaration at ecd.beacukai.go.id and keep the resulting QR code for scanning at the arrival or departure terminal, avoiding physical forms. The e-CD portal's own menu (footer: © 2026 Direktorat Jenderal Bea dan Cukai) separates Kedatangan (arrival) into (UDARA & LAUT) and (DARAT) ECD, and lists under Keberangkatan (departure) two distinct items - Pembawaan Uang (BC 32) for money carriage and Pembawaan Barang (BC 34) for goods - so the outbound cash declaration is the portal's BC 32 menu item, not the BC 2.2 customs-declaration form at /forms/bc22; the menu attests this channel/form classification only, states no filing window, and the form numbers are quoted exactly as displayed without expansion. The e-CD site's own notice states that from 1 September 2025 all passengers and crew bound for Indonesia fill the Customs Declaration via allindonesia.imigrasi.go.id; the land/departure e-CD allocation appears on the customs arrival page of February 2026 build, and per-checkpoint availability is not individually verified.",
            "applicability_zh": "海关现行到达须知指引：经陆路（PLBN口岸）到达的旅客，以及携带等值1亿印尼盾及以上现金或特定其他物品出境的旅客，通过 ecd.beacukai.go.id 填报海关申报表，并保存二维码在到达或出境航站楼交验，免于填纸质表。e-CD 门户自身菜单（页脚 © 2026 Direktorat Jenderal Bea dan Cukai）将 Kedatangan（到达）分为 (UDARA & LAUT) 与 (DARAT) ECD，并在 Keberangkatan（离境）下分列两项——携运货币 Pembawaan Uang (BC 32) 与携运货物 Pembawaan Barang (BC 34)——故出境现金申报对应门户 BC 32 菜单项，而非 /forms/bc22 的 BC 2.2 海关申报表；该菜单仅证此渠道/表单分类，未载任何填报时窗，表号按页面显示原样引用、不作扩展。e-CD 网站自身公告称自2025年9月1日起所有赴印尼旅客与机组经 allindonesia.imigrasi.go.id 填报；陆路/出境 e-CD 划分见于2026年2月构建的海关到达页，逐口岸可用性未逐一核实。",
            "timing_en": "For land (PLBN) arrivals the page states filling can start three days (H-3) before the scheduled arrival in Indonesia. Passengers departing with cash of Rp 100 million equivalent or more, or other specified goods, should submit the declaration online under the official site's provisions, but the source text obtained gives no exact advance-filing window for this departure case - the H-3 sentence in the land/departure section reuses the arrival wording, so the departure e-CD window remains unknown; the e-CD portal menu likewise states no filing window for its Keberangkatan (BC 32/BC 34) items. The Barang Penumpang page's separate 'two days before arrival' sentence is another page's/possibly older usage and is not reconciled with H-3.",
            "timing_zh": "陆路（PLBN）抵达情形：页面载明可自预定抵达印尼前3日（H-3）起填报。携等值1亿印尼盾及以上现金或其他规定物品出境者，应按官网规定在线提交申报，但当前所获原文未给出该出境情形确切的提前填报窗口——陆路/出境段落的 H-3 句系复用“抵达”措辞，出境 e-CD 窗口仍未知；e-CD 门户菜单对其 Keberangkatan（BC 32/BC 34）各项亦未载时窗。Barang Penumpang 页“抵达前两天开始填报”系另页/可能旧用途表述，不与 H-3 强行调和。",
