            "applicability_en": "Direction: foreign nationals and stateless people using passports entering or departing Lao PDR at the four named international checkpoints. Per the Department of Immigration's official announcement (02-09-2025): the Department launched the new Lao Digital Immigration Form (LDIF) to streamline border procedure on 1 September 2025 at four international checkpoints — Wattay International Airport, Luangprabang International Airport, Pakse International Airport and Lao-Thai Friendship Bridge I — and all foreign nationals and stateless people using passports are required to register through LDIF at immigration.gov.la before entering into or departing from Lao PDR. Duty/cash thresholds are covered by the separate verified cash-declaration procedure.",
            "applicability_zh": "方向：持护照进出老挝的外国人和无国籍人。据移民局官方公告（2025-09-02发布）：移民局于2025年9月1日在四个国际口岸启用新的老挝数字入境表（LDIF）以简化边检流程——瓦岱国际机场、琅勃拉邦国际机场、巴色国际机场及老泰友谊大桥I——所有持护照的外国人和无国籍人须在进入或离开老挝前通过 immigration.gov.la 的 LDIF 注册。税费/现金门槛由另一已核现金申报事项覆盖。",
            "timing_en": "Register through LDIF before entering into or departing from Lao PDR (announcement effective from 1 September 2025).",
