            "official_url": "https://www.imi.gov.my/index.php/en/pengumuman/malaysia-digital-arrival-card-mdac/",
            "channel": "online",
            "applicability_en": "Malaysia Foreign Affairs guidance requires foreign citizens travelling to Malaysia to complete MDAC from 1 January 2024, except: Singapore citizens; diplomatic and official passport holders; Malaysian permanent residents and long-term pass holders; Brunei General Certificate of Identity holders; Brunei-Malaysia Frequent Traveller Facility holders; Thai border-pass holders; Indonesian PLB cross-border-document holders. Submit through the Immigration Department portal. An Immigration Department headquarters announcement, retrieved 2026-09-27, adds that MDAC can now be filled directly through the MyNIISe app; the announcement states no eligibility limits and no timing window. This is an immigration arrival card. No official text consulted states a filing fee.",
            "applicability_zh": "马来西亚外交部指引明确，2024年1月1日起赴马外国公民须填MDAC；豁免为新加坡公民、外交与公务护照持有人、马来西亚永久居民及长期准证持有人、文莱General Certificate of Identity证件持有人、文莱马来西亚常旅设施持有人、泰国边境通行证持有人、印尼PLB跨境证件持有人。须经移民局门户提交。移民局总部公告（2026-09-27读取）补充：MDAC现可直接在MyNIISe应用程序填写；公告未写适用限制与时间窗。这属于移民入境卡。所读官方文本均未写提交费用。",
            "timing_en": "Three days before arrival per the embassy notice; a precise 72-hour interpretation is not asserted.",
            "timing_zh": "使馆公告写抵达前三天；不擅自换算为精确72小时。",
