            "id": "MY-currency-declaration",
            "type": "customs_declaration",
            "name_en": "Cash and bearer instruments: Customs Form No. 7",
            "name_zh": "现金与无记名票据：海关第7号表",
            "agency": "Bank Negara Malaysia (BNM) / Royal Malaysian Customs Department",
            "official_url": "https://www.customs.gov.my/images/05-individu/pelancong/English-Pamplet-Cash-Declarations-new-17-Jan-25.pdf",
            "channel": "paper",
            "applicability_en": "The January 2025 Customs pamphlet requires all travellers of any nationality entering or leaving Malaysia with cash and bearer negotiable instruments exceeding USD 10,000.00 equivalent to complete Customs Form No. 7 and submit it physically at a customs counter. Bank Negara Malaysia's current page uses the same exclusive wording: declaration is required for physical notes of either currency more than USD 10,000 equivalent. Importing or exporting Malaysian ringgit above that amount also needs prior written BNM approval, and approval does not remove the declaration. The Customs Travellers Guide, content dated 25 May 2023 and page last updated 5 January 2026, still writes the threshold as cash and BNI amounting to or exceeding USD 10,000.00, so the exactly-USD-10,000 case stays unresolved pending the gazetted declaration order and is not described as safely exempt. Penalties stated in the pamphlet: up to MYR 3 million fine or 5 years' imprisonment for undeclared amounts, up to MYR 50 million or 10 years for ringgit moved without BNM written approval.",
            "applicability_zh": "海关2025年1月英文手册要求任何国籍旅客出入境马来西亚时，携现金及无记名可转让票据超过（exceeding）等值10,000.00美元即填写海关第7号表并亲自交海关柜台。马来西亚国家银行当前页面同样只用「超过」表述：携带任一币种纸币超过等值10,000美元须申报。携入或携出超过该数额的林吉特另须国家银行事先书面批准，批准不免除申报。海关旅客指南正文标注2023年5月25日、页面2026年1月5日更新，仍写现金及BNI达到或超过（amounting to or exceeding）10,000.00美元须申报；取得公报申报命令原文前，恰等于1万美元维持待厘清，不写成可放心免申报。手册所列刑罚：未申报最高300万林吉特罚金或5年监禁；未经国家银行书面批准移动林吉特最高5,000万林吉特或10年监禁。",
            "timing_en": "Submit the paper form at customs counters on entry/exit; as at current practice there is no online submission. BNM processes ringgit-permission applications in a few working days, so apply before travel.",
            "timing_zh": "出入境时在海关柜台提交纸表；按现行做法无线上提交渠道。国家银行审批林吉特携带许可需数个工作日，应在出行前申请。",
            "fee": "unknown",
            "source_ids": [
              "MY-customs2025",
              "MY-malay-guide",
              "MY-bnm-banknotes",
              "MY-customs-travelers-guide"
            ],
            "verified_at": "2026-09-27",
            "name_zh_hant": "現金與無記名票據：海關第7號表",
            "applicability_zh_hant": "海關2025年1月英文手冊要求任何國籍旅客出入境馬來西亞時，攜現金及無記名可轉讓票據超過（exceeding）等值10,000.00美元即填寫海關第7號表並親自交海關櫃檯。馬來西亞國家銀行當前頁面同樣只用「超過」表述：攜帶任一幣種紙幣超過等值10,000美元須申報。攜入或攜出超過該數額的林吉特另須國家銀行事先書面批准，批准不免除申報。海關旅客指南正文標註2023年5月25日、頁面2026年1月5日更新，仍寫現金及BNI達到或超過（amounting to or exceeding）10,000.00美元須申報；取得公報申報命令原文前，恰等於1萬美元維持待釐清，不寫成可放心免申報。手冊所列刑罰：未申報最高300萬林吉特罰金或5年監禁；未經國家銀行書面批准移動林吉特最高5,000萬林吉特或10年監禁。",
            "timing_zh_hant": "出入境時在海關櫃檯提交紙表；按現行做法無線上提交渠道。國家銀行審批林吉特攜帶許可需數個工作日，應在出行前申請。"
