            "id": "BD-currency-regulations",
            "type": "customs_declaration",
            "name_en": "FMJ foreign currency declaration and re-export rules",
            "name_zh": "FMJ外币申报与携回规定",
            "agency": "Bangladesh Customs (National Board of Revenue) with Bangladesh Bank FE Circulars",
            "official_url": "https://www.bb.org.bd/mediaroom/circulars/fepd/feb112020fepd08e.pdf",
            "channel": "conditional",
            "applicability_en": "Bangladesh Bank FE Circular 08 of 11 February 2020 and its amended FMJ form allow incoming passengers to bring up to USD 10,000 equivalent without declaration. Any larger amount may be brought in with FMJ declaration. A foreigner may take out the declared imported amount, or up to USD 10,000 imported without declaration. A Bangladeshi may retain and re-export up to USD 10,000 imported without declaration; resident Bangladeshis must encash or deposit amounts over USD 10,000 within 30 days of arrival, while non-residents may do so at any time after return. The form states a BDT 10,000 allowance for bringing in or taking out Bangladeshi currency. Current annual foreign-exchange purchase/travel quotas are a separate matter and are not established here.",
            "applicability_zh": "孟加拉国银行2020年2月11日第08号外汇通函及修订FMJ表明确：入境携外币不超过等值10,000美元无需申报，更多金额可用FMJ申报携入。外国人可携回已申报的入境金额，或未申报携入的不超过10,000美元。孟加拉国人可保留并携回未申报携入的不超过10,000美元；居民携入超过10,000美元须在抵达后30天内兑换或存入合适外币账户，非居民可在回国后任意时间办理。表格载本币携入或携出额度为10,000塔卡。现行年度购汇与旅行额度另属其他规定，本项未核实。",
            "timing_en": "FMJ at arrival for foreign currency above USD 10,000 equivalent; resident deposit/encashment rule within 30 days.",
            "timing_zh": "入境外币超过等值10,000美元时填FMJ；居民超额外币须在30天内兑换或存入。",
            "fee": "unknown",
