            "official_url": "https://www.customs.gov.lk/about-us/directorates-and-divisions/passenger-services-directorate-katunayake/",
            "channel": "conditional",
            "applicability_en": "Legitimately acquired foreign exchange exceeding USD15,000 equivalent in aggregate must be declared when entering or departing Sri Lanka. Departing passengers must also declare foreign currency notes over USD10,000. Arriving passengers intending to take back foreign notes over USD10,000 must declare them on arrival. The customs page separately states an LKR20,000 local-currency carrying limit; this is not the foreign-exchange reporting threshold.",
            "applicability_zh": "合法取得的外汇合计超过等值15,000美元，入境及出境均须申报；出境携带外币现钞超过10,000美元也须申报。入境时计划再携出超过10,000美元外币现钞的，须在入境时申报。海关另列本币携带上限20,000斯里兰卡卢比，这不是外汇申报门槛。",
            "timing_en": "At entry or departure, as applicable.",
