            "channel": "conditional",
            "applicability_en": "The Sri Lanka Customs Travellers page instructs that foreign currencies, gold jewelleries, goods under FRIC or CARNET, and gems should be declared to the Customs Arrival No 1 Officer on arrival. The page lists these categories without any amount threshold; it does not state that any amount must be declared, and it does not supersede or restate the foreign-exchange amount thresholds kept in LK-customs-rules-reference (record verified 2026-09-12; not re-verified in the 2026-09-27 round).",
            "applicability_zh": "斯里兰卡海关 Travellers 页列明：外币、金饰、FRIC 或 CARNET 项下物品、宝石应在到达时向海关 Customs Arrival No 1 Officer（到达区 1 号关员）申报。该页仅列类别、未列任何金额门槛，不等于任何金额都须申报，也不改写或取代 LK-customs-rules-reference 所保留的外汇金额门槛（该记录核于 2026-09-12，本轮未复核）。",
            "timing_en": "On arrival, to the Customs Arrival No 1 Officer.",
