            "id": "cy-cash-declaration",
            "type": "customs_declaration",
            "name_en": "Cash and gold declaration on entry/exit",
            "name_zh": "现金及黄金出入境申报",
            "agency": "Customs & Excise Department, Ministry of Finance of Cyprus",
            "official_url": "https://www.mof.gov.cy/mof/customs/customs.nsf/All/D80A051C99A6F3DAC22578570032A9BA?OpenDocument",
            "channel": "on_arrival",
            "applicability_en": "Persons holding or carrying cash (or gold and other highly-liquid stores of value) of a value equal to or exceeding EUR 10,000 must declare the sum to the Customs Authorities when entering or leaving through Cyprus (Law 53(I)/2009; Reg (EC) 1889/2005). Non-declaration can lead to seizure and fines up to EUR 50,000. Page footer states last updated 10/2/2020.",
            "applicability_zh": "在塞浦路斯出入境携带等于或超过 1 万欧元的现金或黄金等高流动性价值物须向海关申报（Law 53(I)/2009、Reg (EC) 1889/2005）；未申报可被没收并罚款最高 5 万欧元。页面页尾标注更新于 2020-10-02，为该官网现行版本。",
            "timing_en": "Declare to customs officers at the border (red channel at Larnaca/Paphos airports and Limassol port).",
            "timing_zh": "在边境向海关关员申报（Larnaca/Paphos 机场与 Limassol 港设红绿双通道）。",
            "fee": "unknown",
