        "procedures": [
          {
            "id": "VA-cross-border-cash-written-declaration",
            "type": "customs_declaration",
            "name_en": "Written declaration for cross-border transportation of cash of €10,000 or more — Law N. XVIII of 8 October 2013, Art. 82 (formerly Art. 81), as amended by Law N. DCXIV of 7 November 2023",
            "name_zh": "跨境携带1万欧元（含）及以上现金的书面申报——2013年10月8日第XVIII号法第82条（原第81条），经2023年11月7日第DCXIV号法修正",
            "agency": "Corpo della Gendarmeria dello Stato della Città del Vaticano (Gendarmerie Corps of Vatican City State), or offices authorized by the Autorità di Supervisione e Informazione Finanziaria (ASIF, Supervisory and Financial Information Authority)",
            "official_url": "https://www.vaticanstate.va/it/stato-e-governo/legislazione-e-normativa/normativa-prevenzione-e-contrasto-in-materia-finanziaria-e-ft.html",
            "channel": "paper",
            "applicability_en": "Direction: both entering and leaving Vatican City State ('in entrata o in uscita dallo Stato') — the duty is bidirectional. Anyone ('Chiunque') who effects a cross-border transportation, entering or leaving the State, of cash (denaro contante) to the value of €10,000 or more must make a written declaration at the offices of the Gendarmerie Corps or at offices authorized by the Supervisory and Financial Information Authority (the original 2013 text names the 'Autorità di Informazione Finanziaria', renamed 'Autorità di Supervisione e Informazione Finanziaria' in the current consolidated wording). The threshold 'pari o superiore a 10.000 euro' is inclusive: exactly €10,000 already triggers the duty. The declaration includes: the declarant's identification data; the particulars of the owner and of the recipient of the cash; the amount and nature of the cash; its origin and destination; the itinerary followed; and the means of transport used. The obligation is not satisfied if the information provided is inaccurate or incomplete. Sanctions (Art. 86 as renumbered, formerly Art. 85): in case of a false, omitted or incomplete declaration the holder must rectify or complete it and incurs an administrative pecuniary sanction of 10% to 40% of the sums possessed exceeding the €10,000 limit; the Gendarmerie may, at the time the violation is contested, seize up to 40% of the excess sums as a guarantee. Scope note: this is Vatican City State law on the physical cross-border transportation of cash by the person carrying it; it is not an Italian or EU customs regime, and obligations for postal or commercial channels are outside this record's scope.",
            "applicability_zh": "方向：进入或离开梵蒂冈城邦均可触发（'in entrata o in uscita dallo Stato'）——该义务为双向。任何人（'Chiunque'）跨境运送、即进入或离开该城邦时携带价值 10,000 欧元（含）及以上的现金（denaro contante），必须在宪兵部队（Gendarmeria）办公室或监督与金融信息局（ASIF；2013年原文称'Autorità di Informazione Finanziaria'，现行合并文本称'Autorità di Supervisione e Informazione Finanziaria'）授权的办公室递交书面申报。门槛'pari o superiore a 10.000 euro'含本数：恰为 10,000 欧元即触发义务。申报内容包括：申报人身份资料；现金所有人与接收人的概况；现金金额与性质；来源与去向；所经路线；所用运输工具。所提供资料不准确或不完整的，义务即未满足。罚则（改号后第86条，原第85条）：申报虚假、遗漏或不完整的，持有人须更正或补全申报，并被处超出 10,000 欧元限额部分金额 10%至40%的行政罚款；宪兵部队可在指控违规时扣押超额部分至多 40%的款项作为担保。范围说明：这是梵蒂冈城邦关于随身跨境携带现金的本国法律，不是意大利或欧盟海关规则；邮寄或商业渠道的义务不在本记录范围内。",
            "timing_en": "Under Law N. XVIII, Art. 82 as amended by Law N. DCXIV of 2023, anyone carrying €10,000 or more across the border, in either direction (entering or leaving the State), must file a written declaration at the Gendarmerie offices or at offices authorized by ASIF. The exact filing time-point relative to the border crossing (before or at) remains unknown (see unresolved note VA-cash-declaration-ordinance-and-form-fields-not-captured).",
            "timing_zh": "依法（2013年第XVIII号法第82条，经2023年第DCXIV号法修正），进入或离开梵蒂冈城邦任一方向携带 10,000 欧元（含）及以上现金，均须向宪兵部队办公室或 ASIF 授权办公室递交书面申报。申报相对过境的准确时点（过境前还是过境时递交）仍未知（见未决注记 VA-cash-declaration-ordinance-and-form-fields-not-captured）。",
            "fee": "unknown",
            "source_ids": [
              "VA-legge-xviii-2013-official",
              "VA-legge-dcxiv-2023-official",
              "VA-asif-consolidated-xviii"
            ],
            "verified_at": "2026-09-27",
            "name_zh_hant": "跨境攜帶1萬歐元（含）及以上現金的書面申報——2013年10月8日第XVIII號法第82條（原第81條），經2023年11月7日第DCXIV號法修正",
            "applicability_zh_hant": "方向：進入或離開梵蒂岡城邦均可觸發（'in entrata o in uscita dallo Stato'）——該義務為雙向。任何人（'Chiunque'）跨境運送、即進入或離開該城邦時攜帶價值 10,000 歐元（含）及以上的現金（denaro contante），必須在憲兵部隊（Gendarmeria）辦公室或監督與金融資訊局（ASIF；2013年原文稱'Autorità di Informazione Finanziaria'，現行合併文本稱'Autorità di Supervisione e Informazione Finanziaria'）授權的辦公室遞交書面申報。門檻'pari o superiore a 10.000 euro'含本數：恰為 10,000 歐元即觸發義務。申報內容包括：申報人身份資料；現金所有人與接收人的概況；現金金額與性質；來源與去向；所經路線；所用運輸工具。所提供資料不準確或不完整的，義務即未滿足。罰則（改號後第86條，原第85條）：申報虛假、遺漏或不完整的，持有人須更正或補全申報，並被處超出 10,000 歐元限額部分金額 10%至40%的行政罰款；憲兵部隊可在指控違規時扣押超額部分至多 40%的款項作為擔保。範圍說明：這是梵蒂岡城邦關於隨身跨境攜帶現金的本國法律，不是意大利或歐盟海關規則；郵寄或商業渠道的義務不在本記錄範圍內。",
            "timing_zh_hant": "依法（2013年第XVIII號法第82條，經2023年第DCXIV號法修正），進入或離開梵蒂岡城邦任一方向攜帶 10,000 歐元（含）及以上現金，均須向憲兵部隊辦公室或 ASIF 授權辦公室遞交書面申報。申報相對過境的準確時點（過境前還是過境時遞交）仍未知（見未決註記 VA-cash-declaration-ordinance-and-form-fields-not-captured）。"
          }
        ],
