          {
            "id": "sm-traveller-cash-declaration",
            "type": "customs_declaration",
            "name_en": "Accompanied cash declaration on entering or leaving San Marino (EUR 10,000 or more)",
            "name_zh": "进出圣马力诺随身现金申报（1万欧元及以上）",
            "agency": "Repubblica di San Marino — Forze di Polizia (paper form delivered at the Comando or detached station nearest the crossed border; telematic declaration via www.ttc.sm; legal basis: Decreto Delegato 5 ottobre 2022 n. 141 e succ.mod.)",
            "official_url": "https://www.gov.sm/pub1/GovSM/Amministrazione-Trasparente/Organizzazione-dell-Amministrazione/Forze-dell-ordine/Trasferimento-Transfrontaliero-Di-Denaro-Contante.html",
            "channel": "conditional",
            "applicability_en": "A natural person entering or leaving the territory of the Republic of San Marino who carries \"denaro contante\" with a total value equal to or above EUR 10,000 must declare it as an accompanied transfer (\"pari o superiore a 10.000 euro\" — the threshold includes exactly EUR 10,000). \"Denaro contante\" covers banknotes and coins in circulation (or exchangeable for circulating currency); bearer-negotiable instruments (traveller's cheques; bearer cheques, bills of exchange and payment orders); gold coins with at least 90% gold content and gold bars, nuggets or aggregates with at least 99.5% gold; and non-named prepaid cards not linked to a bank account. The duty applies even if the traveller is not stopped by a police officer. Cash moved by post, courier, aircraft or other cargo follows the separate unaccompanied (\"Non Accompagnato\") declaration and is out of scope here.",
            "applicability_zh": "进入或离开圣马力诺共和国领土、随身携带“现金（denaro contante）”且总额“pari o superiore a 10.000 euro”（满1万欧元及以上，含恰好1万欧元）的自然人，必须按“随行现金（Accompagnato）”办理申报。“现金”范围：流通中（或可经金融机构/央行兑换为流通中）的纸币与硬币；无记名可转让票据（旅行支票；无记名支票、汇票及支付命令）；含金量≥90%的金币与≥99.5%的金条/金块/金砂聚合体；不记名且未关联银行账户的预付卡。即使未被执法警察拦停，申报义务同样存在。经邮政、快递、航空或其他货运方式移动的非随身现金适用另行“非随行（Non Accompagnato）”申报（收件人于收到后48小时内、寄件人最迟于交寄时），不在本条范围。",
            "timing_en": "Paper channel: deliver the completed accompanied-transfer form to the Comando or detached station of the Forza di Polizia nearest the crossed border. Electronic channel (equivalent alternative offered on the same page): file on www.ttc.sm before crossing the border and carry the telematic registration number with you. DD141 original (2026-09-29): the allegato 1 declaration is either transmitted telematically before crossing — the carrier then keeps a paper or electronic copy with the registration number — or delivered in writing to the Comando or detached station of the Forza di Polizia nearest the crossed or intended border point, which releases a copy bearing the office's attestation of receipt (\"copia con attestazione di ricevimento da parte dell'ufficio\" — an office receipt attestation, not a countersignature), and the carrier must carry that copy with them (\"tale copia deve essere portata al seguito dal portatore\"). Unaccompanied transfers ≥€10,000 require the sender's allegato 2 information at the latest at dispatch.",
            "timing_zh": "纸质渠道：将填妥的“随行现金”申报表递交至距所越边境最近的警察部队（Forza di Polizia）指挥部或派驻机构。电子渠道（同一官方页面的等效替代）：越境前在 www.ttc.sm 在线提交，并随身携带系统赋予的申报注册号。 DD141 原文（2026-09-29）：附件1申报可在跨越边境前以电子方式传送（携纸本或电子副本及系统注册号），或书面递交至所越或拟越边境点最近的警察部队（Forza di Polizia）指挥部/派出机构，由该机构签发附办公室收讫证明的副本（copia con attestazione di ricevimento da parte dell'ufficio，系办公室收讫证明而非“会签/countersigned”），且携带人须将该副本随身携带（tale copia deve essere portata al seguito dal portatore）；不随行 ≥€10,000 现金最迟于交寄时由寄件人按附件2履行信息义务。",
            "fee": "unknown",
            "source_ids": [
              "sm-govsm-trasferimento",
              "sm-govsm-dd141-consolidato"
            ],
            "verified_at": "2026-09-29",
            "name_zh_hant": "進出聖馬力諾隨身現金申報（1萬歐元及以上）",
            "applicability_zh_hant": "進入或離開聖馬力諾共和國領土、隨身攜帶“現金（denaro contante）”且總額“pari o superiore a 10.000 euro”（滿1萬歐元及以上，含恰好1萬歐元）的自然人，必須按“隨行現金（Accompagnato）”辦理申報。“現金”範圍：流通中（或可經金融機構/央行兌換為流通中）的紙幣與硬幣；無記名可轉讓票據（旅行支票；無記名支票、匯票及支付命令）；含金量≥90%的金幣與≥99.5%的金條/金塊/金砂聚合體；不記名且未關聯銀行賬戶的預付卡。即使未被執法警察攔停，申報義務同樣存在。經郵政、快遞、航空或其他貨運方式移動的非隨身現金適用另行“非隨行（Non Accompagnato）”申報（收件人於收到後48小時內、寄件人最遲於交寄時），不在本條範圍。",
            "timing_zh_hant": "紙質渠道：將填妥的“隨行現金”申報表遞交至距所越邊境最近的警察部隊（Forza di Polizia）指揮部或派駐機構。電子渠道（同一官方頁面的等效替代）：越境前在 www.ttc.sm 線上提交，並隨身攜帶系統賦予的申報註冊號。 DD141 原文（2026-09-29）：附件1申報可在跨越邊境前以電子方式傳送（攜紙本或電子副本及系統註冊號），或書面遞交至所越或擬越邊境點最近的警察部隊（Forza di Polizia）指揮部/派出機構，由該機構簽發附辦公室收訖證明的副本（copia con attestazione di ricevimento da parte dell'ufficio，系辦公室收訖證明而非“會籤/countersigned”），且攜帶人須將該副本隨身攜帶（tale copia deve essere portata al seguito dal portatore）；不隨行 ≥€10,000 現金最遲於交寄時由寄件人按附件2履行資訊義務。"
          }
