            "agency": "Generalzolldirektion / Zoll (German Customs)",
            "official_url": "https://www.zoll.de/EN/Private-individuals/Travel/Entering-Germany/Duties-and-taxes/Travellers-allowances/travellers-allowances_node.html",
            "channel": "conditional",
            "applicability_en": "Entering Germany from a non-EU country: goods up to EUR 300 duty-free (EUR 430 for air/sea travellers, EUR 175 for travellers under 15). Alcohol (17+): 1 L spirits over 22% vol or 2 L up to 22%, plus 4 L still wine and 16 L beer. Tobacco (17+): 200 cigarettes or 100 cigarillos or 50 cigars or 250 g tobacco. Fuel: tank plus up to 10 L in a portable container. Goods above the allowances must be declared and taxed on the whole item value.",
            "applicability_zh": "自非欧盟国家入境德国：商品价值免税额 300 欧（飞机/海路 430 欧，15 岁以下 175 欧）；酒精（17 岁以上）22% vol 以上 1 升或 22% 及以下 2 升，另加 4 升不起泡葡萄酒和 16 升啤酒；烟草（17 岁以上）200 支香烟或 100 支 cigarillos 或 50 支雪茄或 250 克烟丝；燃料为油箱加最多 10 升备用。超出免税额的商品须申报并按整件计税。",
            "timing_en": "Use the red channel / declare to customs on arrival; the current official page is travellers-allowances_node.html (previously cited _functions.html URL is dead).",
            "timing_zh": "入境走红通道或向海关申报；现行官方页为 travellers-allowances_node.html（原引用的 _functions.html 已失效）。",
