            "title": "Ordonnance Souveraine n° 2.318 du 3 août 2009 — complete current HTML page as served by Legimonaco, captured 2026-09-29T22:48 UTC (2026-09-30 JST) after a 302 redirect, HTTP 200, 467,585 bytes, Last-Modified 2026-05-27, raw tail complete (ends </body></html>); og:url and itemprop path confirm the served consolidation @2025.06.07 (generator SCENARI 6.1.16 / legiMonacoRef 1.5.0, page revision meta 2026-05-27 08:47); mechanical text extraction 2,845 lines, read in full. Verified to contain Arts. 1–64 plus the annex, closing the 2026-09-29 truncation gap: Chapitre XVI 'Transport transfrontalier d'argent liquide' (Arts. 51-1–54) — Art. 51-1 (créé à compter du 31 décembre 2021 par l'ordonnance n° 8.634 du 29 avril 2021) defines argent liquide (espèces; instruments négociables au porteur incl. chèques de voyage; pièces ≥90 % d'or and métal non monnayé ≥99,5 % d'or; cartes prépayées non nominatives); Art. 52 designates the Direction de la Sûreté Publique as autorité de contrôle and requires the annex form 'formulaire tenu à la disposition du public'; Art. 53 provides only postal submission before transport or hand-over to a Sûreté Publique agent at the latest during transport; Art. 54 duplicate retention; Art. 64 fixes the Law Arts. 60/60-1 amounts at 10.000 euros; annex 'pour une valeur totale excédant 10.000 euros'. No electronic filing channel for the Arts. 60/60-1 traveller declarations appears anywhere in the ordinance text (electronic-mode provisions at Arts. 35-2, 36-2-1, 37, 38-2, 63 concern professionals/registries); latest amendment marker in the full text is OS 11.242 of 30 May 2025 (Arts. 12-2, 55–57) — none later than the @2025.06.07 consolidation. Supersedes the truncated 2026-09-29 render capture for full-text claims; makes no claim about channels outside the ordinance text (e.g., a Direction de la Sûreté Publique service page).",
